#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.title"
msgstr "Kuhlaziywa kwelungelo lokushicilela kuyimfuneko yokhuseleko lwesizwe"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.tldr"
msgstr "TL;DR: I-LLM zaseTshayina (kubandakanya i-DeepSeek) ziqeqeshwe kwindawo yam yokugcina iincwadi kunye namaphepha ngokungekho mthethweni — ezona zinkulu emhlabeni. Iintshona kufuneka zihlaziye umthetho welungelo lokushicilela njengomcimbi wokhuseleko lwesizwe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.subtitle"
msgstr "amanqaku ahambelanayo nguTorrentFreak: <a %(torrentfreak)s>eyokuqala</a>, <a %(torrentfreak_2)s>eyesibini</a>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text1"
msgstr "Kungekudala, \"iithala leencwadi ezisemthunzini\" zazisifa. I-Sci-Hub, indawo enkulu yokugcina amaphepha ezemfundo ngokungekho mthethweni, yayiyekile ukuthatha imisebenzi emitsha, ngenxa yezimangalo. \"I-Z-Library\", elona thala leencwadi likhulu ngokungekho mthethweni, yabona abenzi bayo abathiwe thaca bebotshelwe izityholo zokophula ilungelo lokushicilela. Baphumelele ngokumangalisayo ekubalekeni ukubanjwa kwabo, kodwa ithala labo leencwadi alikho ngaphantsi kwesoyikiso."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text2"
msgstr "Xa i-Z-Library yayijongene nokuvalwa, ndandisele ndigcine yonke ithala layo leencwadi kwaye ndifuna iqonga lokuyibamba. Yayiyinjongo yam ukuqala i-Archive ka-Anna: ukuqhubeka komsebenzi emva kwezi zinyathelo zangaphambili. Ukusukela ngoko, sikhule saba lelona thala leencwadi elisemthunzini likhulu emhlabeni, sibamba ngaphezu kwe-140 yezigidi zemibhalo enelungelo lokushicilela kwiifomathi ezininzi — iincwadi, amaphepha ezemfundo, iimagazini, amaphephandaba, nangaphaya."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text3"
msgstr "Iqela lam kunye nam singabantu abakholelwa kwizimvo ezithile. Sikholelwa ukuba ukugcina kunye nokubamba ezi fayile kulungile ngokokuziphatha. Iithala leencwadi kwihlabathi liphela zibona ukuncitshiswa kwemali, kwaye asinakuthembela kwilifa loluntu kwiinkampani."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text4"
msgstr "Emva koko kweza i-AI. Phantse zonke iinkampani ezinkulu ezakha ii-LLM zasinxibelelana ukuze ziqeqeshe kwidatha yethu. Uninzi (kodwa hayi zonke!) iinkampani zase-US zacinga kwakhona xa ziqonda uhlobo olungekho mthethweni lomsebenzi wethu. Ngokwahlukileyo, iinkampani zaseTshayina zamkele ngentumekelelo ingqokelela yethu, ngokucacileyo zingakhathazeki ngokusemthethweni kwayo. Oku kubalulekile xa kuthathelwa ingqalelo indima yaseTshayina njengomtyikityi phantse kuzo zonke izivumelwano zamazwe ngamazwe zelungelo lokushicilela."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text5"
msgstr "Sinikeze ukufikelela ngesantya esiphezulu malunga neenkampani ezingama-30. Uninzi lwazo ziinkampani ze-LLM, kwaye ezinye ngabathengisi bedatha, abaza kuphinda bathengise ingqokelela yethu. Uninzi lwazo ziinkampani zaseTshayina, nangona sisebenze neenkampani ezivela e-US, eYurophu, eRashiya, eMzantsi Korea, naseJapan. I-DeepSeek <a %(arxiv)s>ivumile</a> ukuba inguqulelo yangaphambili yaqeqeshwa kwinxalenye yengqokelela yethu, nangona bepholile malunga nemodeli yabo yamva nje (mhlawumbi nayo iqeqeshwe kwidatha yethu)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text6"
msgstr "Ukuba iNtshona ifuna ukuhlala phambili kumdyarho wee-LLM, kwaye ekugqibeleni, i-AGI, kufuneka icinge kwakhona isikhundla sayo kwilungelo lokushicilela, kwaye kungekudala. Nokuba uyavumelana nathi okanye awuvumelani nathi kwimeko yethu yokuziphatha, oku ngoku kuba ngumcimbi wezoqoqosho, kwaye nokuba wokhuseleko lwesizwe. Zonke iibhulokhi zamandla zakha oososayensi abakhulu bokwenziwa, abaphuli-mthetho abakhulu, kunye nemikhosi emikhulu. Inkululeko yolwazi iba ngumcimbi wokusinda kwezi zizwe — nokuba ngumcimbi wokhuseleko lwesizwe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text7"
msgstr "Iqela lethu livela kwihlabathi liphela, kwaye asinayo inkxaso ethile. Kodwa siza kukhuthaza amazwe anemithetho eqinileyo yelungelo lokushicilela ukuba basebenzise esi sithintelo sokuhlaziya. Ke yintoni ekufuneka yenziwe?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text8"
msgstr "Isindululo sethu sokuqala silula: nciphisa ixesha lokulawula ilungelo lokushicilela. E-US, ilungelo lokushicilela linikwa iminyaka engama-70 emva kokufa kombhali. Oku kuyinto engamkelekanga. Singalingenisa oku kumgangatho weepatent, ezinikwa iminyaka engama-20 emva kokufayilisha. Oku kufuneka kube ngaphezu kokwaneleyo kubabhali beencwadi, amaphepha, umculo, ubugcisa, kunye neminye imisebenzi yokuyila, ukufumana imbuyekezo epheleleyo yemigudu yabo (kubandakanya iiprojekthi zexesha elide ezifana nokulungelelaniswa kweefilimu)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text9"
msgstr "Emva koko, ubuncinci, abenzi bomgaqo-nkqubo kufuneka babandakanye izikhewu zokugcinwa okukhulu kunye nokusasazwa kwemibhalo. Ukuba ingeniso elahlekileyo evela kubathengi ngabanye yeyona nto ixhalabisayo, ukusasazwa kwinqanaba lomntu ngamnye kungahlala kuthintelwe. Ngokulandelelana, abo banamandla okulawula iindawo ezinkulu zokugcina — iinkampani eziqeqesha ii-LLM, kunye neethala leencwadi kunye nezinye iindawo zokugcina — baya kugutyungelwa zezi zinto ezizodwa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text10"
msgstr "Amanye amazwe sele esenza inguqulelo yoku. I-TorrentFreak <a %(torrentfreak)s>ixele</a> ukuba i-China ne-Japan ziye zazisa izikhewu ze-AI kwimithetho yazo yelungelo lokushicilela. Akucaci kuthi ukuba oku kudibana njani nezivumelwano zamazwe ngamazwe, kodwa ngokuqinisekileyo kunika ukhuseleko kwiinkampani zabo zasekhaya, nto leyo echaza into esiyibonayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text11"
msgstr "Ngokuphathelele i-Archive ka-Anna — siya kuqhubeka nomsebenzi wethu ongaphantsi komhlaba osuselwe kukholo lokuziphatha. Nangona kunjalo, umnqweno wethu omkhulu kukungena ekukhanyeni, kwaye sandise impembelelo yethu ngokusemthethweni. Nceda uhlaziye ilungelo lokushicilela."

#, fuzzy
