msgstr "Le <a %(phiresky_github)s>ngeniso</a> (<a %(annas_archive_note_2951)s>ingxelo yeGitlab</a>) iyinto yonke esiyifunayo, nangaphezulu! Sithandile ngokukodwa iindlela zokubonisa eziguquguqukayo kakhulu (nkqu nokuxhasa i-shaders yesiko), kodwa ngoluhlu olubanzi lweepresets. Sikwathande indlela yonke into ekhawulezayo kwaye igudileyo, ukufakwa okulula (okungenaso isiseko), imephu encinci ehlakaniphile, kunye nenkcazo ebanzi kwisithuba sabo se<a %(phiresky_github)s>bhlogi</a>. Umsebenzi omangalisayo, kunye nomphumeleli ofanelwe kakuhle!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second"
msgstr "Indawo yesibini $3,000: hypha"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second.text1"
msgstr "Enye <a %(annas_archive_note_2913)s>ngeniso</a> emangalisayo. Ayiguquguquki njengendawo yokuqala, kodwa siyithandile ngokwenene indlela yayo yokubonisa kwinqanaba eliphezulu ngaphezu kwendawo yokuqala (ijika elizalisa isithuba, imida, ukubhalwa, ukugxininiswa, ukujonga, kunye nokusondeza). Ingxelo <a %(annas_archive_note_2971)s>kaJoe Davis</a> yachukumisa thina:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second.quote"
msgstr "“Nangona izikwere ezigqibeleleyo kunye neerectangles ziyonwabisa ngokwe-mathematika, aziboneleli ngobume obungcono kwimeko yokumapa. Ndiyakholelwa ukuba ukungalingani okukhoyo kwezi Hilbert okanye iMorton zakudala asiyonto engalunganga kodwa yinto ebalulekileyo. Njengoko umda we-Itali owaziwayo ngokuba yibhuthi uyenza ibe yaziwa ngokukhawuleza kwimephu, 'iimpawu' ezizodwa zezi jiko zinokusebenza njengezikhumbuzo zengqondo. Le meko ingakhethekileyo inokuphucula inkumbulo yendawo kwaye incede abasebenzisi bazibeke, mhlawumbi benze kube lula ukufumana iindawo ezithile okanye ukuqaphela iipateni.”"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second.text2"
msgstr "Kwaye kusekho iindlela ezininzi zokubonisa kunye nokwenza, kunye ne-UI egudileyo kakhulu kwaye intle. Indawo yesibini eqinileyo!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third1"
msgstr "Indawo yesithathu $500 #1: maxlion"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third1.text1"
msgstr "Kule <a %(annas_archive_note_2940)s>ngeniso</a> sithandile ngokwenene iintlobo ezahlukeneyo zokujonga, ngakumbi ukujonga kunye nokujonga kwabapapashi."

#, fuzzy
