#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third2.text1"
msgstr "Nangona i-UI ingeyona igqibeleleyo, le <a %(annas_archive_note_2917)s>ngeniso</a> ihlangabezana nezinto ezininzi. Sithandile ngokukodwa umba wayo wokuthelekisa."

