#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third3.text1"
msgstr "Njengendawo yokuqala, le <a %(annas_archive_note_2975)s>ngeniso</a> yasimangalisa ngokuguquguquka kwayo. Ekugqibeleni le yinto eyenza isixhobo esikhulu sokubonisa: ukuguquguquka okuphezulu kubasebenzisi abanamandla, ngelixa kugcinwa izinto zilula kubasebenzisi abaqhelekileyo."

