#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third4.text1"
msgstr "Ingxelo yokugqibela <a %(annas_archive_note_2947)s>ukufumana umvuzo</a> ilula kakhulu, kodwa inezinto ezizodwa esizithandileyo. Sithandile indlela ababonisa ngayo ukuba zingaphi iiDatasets ezigubungela i-ISBN ethile njengomlinganiselo wokuthandwa/ukuthembeka. Sikwathande kakhulu ubulula kodwa ukusebenza kakuhle kokusebenzisa isilayida sokungafihliyo kuthelekiso."

