#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.title"
msgstr "Ukuveza Zonke Izincwadi — Umklomelo ka-$10,000 ngo-2025-01-31"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.tldr"
msgstr "Lesi sithombe simelela uhlu lwezincwadi olukhulu kunawo wonke oluvulekile olwakhiwe emlandweni wesintu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.text1"
msgstr "Lesi sithombe singama-pixels angu-1000×800. I-pixel ngayinye imelela ama-ISBN angu-2,500. Uma sinayo ifayela le-ISBN, senza leyo pixel ibe luhlaza kakhulu. Uma sazi ukuthi i-ISBN ikhishwe, kodwa asinayo ifayela elihambisanayo, senza ibe bomvu kakhulu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.text2"
msgstr "Ngaphansi kuka-300kb, lesi sithombe simelela ngokufingqiwe uhlu lwezincwadi olukhulu kunawo wonke oluvulekile olwakhiwe emlandweni wesintu (ama-GB ambalwa acebile agcwele)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.text3"
msgstr "Kubonisa futhi: kunomsebenzi omningi osele ekusekeleni izincwadi (sine-16% kuphela)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.background"
msgstr "Isizinda"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.background.text1"
msgstr "Indlela i-Archive ka-Anna enokufezekisa ngayo injongo yayo yokugcina ulwazi lonke lwesintu, ngaphandle kokwazi ukuba zeziphi iincwadi ezikhoyo? Sifuna uluhlu lwe-TODO. Enye indlela yokuyila oku kukusebenzisa amanani e-ISBN, awathi ukusukela ngeminyaka yee-1970 anikezelwe kuyo yonke incwadi epapashiweyo (kumazwe amaninzi)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.background.text2"
msgstr "Akukho gunya eliphakathi elazi zonke izabelo ze-ISBN. Endaweni yoko, yinkqubo esasazekileyo, apho amazwe afumana uluhlu lwamanani, aze anikezele uluhlu oluncinci kubapapashi abakhulu, abaza kuthi bahlule uluhlu kubapapashi abancinci. Ekugqibeleni, amanani ngamnye anikezelwa kwiincwadi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.background.text3"
msgstr "Siqale ukulandelela i-ISBNs <a %(blog)s>kwiminyaka emibini edlulileyo</a> ngokuqokelela kwethu i-ISBNdb. Ukusukela ngoko, siqokelele imithombo emininzi ye-metadata, efana ne-<a %(blog_2)s>Worldcat</a>, Google Books, Goodreads, Libby, kunye nokunye. Uluhlu olupheleleyo lunokufumaneka kumaphepha e-“Datasets” kunye ne-“Torrents” kwi-Archive ka-Anna. Ngoku sinengqokelela enkulu evulekileyo, elula ukuyikhuphela ye-metadata yeencwadi (kunye ne-ISBNs) ehlabathini."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.background.text4"
msgstr "Siye <a %(blog)s>sabhala ngokubanzi</a> malunga nokuba kutheni sinomdla wokugcina, kunye nokuba kutheni sikwiwindow ebalulekileyo ngoku. Kufuneka ngoku sichonge iincwadi ezinqabileyo, ezingagxilwanga, kunye nezo zisengozini ekhethekileyo kwaye sizigcine. Ukuba ne-metadata elungileyo kuyo yonke incwadi ehlabathini kuyanceda ngaloo nto."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.visualizing"
msgstr "Ukujonga"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.visualizing.text1"
msgstr "Ngaphandle komfanekiso wesishwankathelo, sinokujonga kwakhona kwi-datasets esizifumeneyo. Sebenzisa i-dropdown kunye namaqhosha ukutshintsha phakathi kwazo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.visualizing.text2"
msgstr "Kukho iipateni ezininzi ezinomdla zokubona kwezi mifanekiso. Kutheni kukho ukulandelelana kwemigca kunye neebhloko, ezibonakala zenzeka kumlinganiselo ohlukeneyo? Zeziphi iindawo ezingenanto? Kutheni ezinye i-datasets zixinene kangaka? Siza kushiya le mibuzo njengomsebenzi kubafundi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty"
msgstr "Umvuzo we-$10,000"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.text1"
msgstr "Kukho okuninzi okufunekayo apha, ngoko ke sibhengeza umvuzo wokuphucula umboniso ongentla. Ngokungafaniyo nemivuzo yethu emininzi, le inexesha elimisiweyo. Kufuneka <a %(annas_archive)s>ungenise</a> ikhowudi yakho evulekileyo ngo-2025-01-31 (23:59 UTC)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.text2"
msgstr "Owona mnikelo ubalaseleyo uya kufumana $6,000, indawo yesibini yi-$3,000, kwaye indawo yesithathu yi-$1,000. Yonke imivuzo iya kunikwa kusetyenziswa i-Monero (XMR)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.text3"
msgstr "Ngezantsi kukho imigangatho emincinci. Ukuba akukho mnikelo uhambelana nemigangatho, sinokuthi sisahlule imivuzo ethile, kodwa oko kuya kuba kukubona kwethu."

