#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.goals.text3"
msgstr "Njengoko i-Archive ka-Anna ivulelekile, sifuna ukusebenzisa ifomathi yethu ngokuthe ngqo. Xa sihlaziya isalathiso sethu sokukhangela, sifikelela kuphela kwiindlela ezifumaneka esidlangalaleni, ukuze nabani na ophinda athathe ithala lethu akwazi ukuqala ngokukhawuleza."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.heading"
msgstr "Umgangatho"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.text1"
msgstr "Ekugqibeleni, sagqiba ekubeni sisebenzise umgangatho olula. Awukhululekanga kakhulu, awunamthetho, kwaye usasebenza."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aac"
msgstr "<strong>AAC.</strong> I-AAC (Isikhongozeli se-Archieve ka-Anna) yinto enye equlathe <strong>metadata</strong>, kwaye ngokuzikhethela <strong>idatha yebhayinari</strong>, zombini ezingaguqukiyo. Inesazisi esikhethekileyo kwihlabathi liphela, esibizwa ngokuba yi-<strong>AACID</strong>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.collection"
msgstr "<strong>Ingqokelela.</strong> I-AAC nganye yeyengqokelela, ethetha uluhlu lwe-AACs ezihambelana ngokwasemantiki. Oko kuthetha ukuba ukuba wenza utshintsho olubalulekileyo kwifomathi yedatha, kufuneka wenze ingqokelela entsha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.records-files"
msgstr "<strong>“iirekhodi” kunye “neefayile” iingqokelela.</strong> Ngokwesiko, kuluncedo ukukhupha “iirekhodi” kunye “neefayile” njengeengqokelela ezahlukeneyo, ukuze zikhutshwe kwiishedyuli ezahlukeneyo, umzekelo, ngokusekelwe kumazinga okukhuhla. “Irekhodi” yingqokelela yedatha kuphela, equlathe ulwazi olufana nezihloko zeencwadi, ababhali, ii-ISBN, njl., ngelixa “iifayile” ziingqokelela eziqulathe iifayile ezizezona (pdf, epub)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid"
msgstr "<strong>AACID.</strong> Ifomathi ye-AACID yile: <code style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__{collection}__{ISO 8601 timestamp}__{collection-specific ID}__{shortuuid}</code>. Umzekelo, i-AACID esiyikhuphileyo yi-<code style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__zlib3_records__20230808T014342Z__22433983__URsJNGy5CjokTsNT6hUmmj</code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.collection"
msgstr "<code>{collection}</code>: igama lengqokelela, elinokuthi libe neencwadi ze-ASCII, amanani, kunye neempawu zokungaphantsi (kodwa hayi iimpawu zokungaphantsi eziphindwe kabini)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.iso8601"
msgstr "<code>{ISO 8601 timestamp}</code>: inguqulelo emfutshane ye-ISO 8601, ihlala ikwi-UTC, umzekelo <code>20220723T194746Z</code>. Eli nani kufuneka lenyuke ngokulandelelana ngalo lonke ukukhutshwa, nangona intsingiselo yalo ichaneke ingahluka ngokwengqokelela. Sicebisa ukusebenzisa ixesha lokukhuhla okanye lokwenza isazisi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.collection-id"
msgstr "<code>{collection-specific ID}</code>: isazisi esithile sengqokelela, ukuba siyasebenza, umzekelo i-ID yeZ-Library. Inokushiywa okanye ifutshane. Kufuneka ishiywe okanye ifutshane ukuba i-AACID ingaphaya kweempawu ezili-150."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.shortuuid"
msgstr "<code>{shortuuid}</code>: i-UUID kodwa icinezelwe kwi-ASCII, umzekelo usebenzisa i-base57. Okwangoku sisebenzisa i <a %(github_skorokithakis_shortuuid)s>shortuuid</a> ilayibrari yePython."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid-range"
msgstr "<strong>Uluhlu lwe-AACID.</strong> Njengoko ii-AACID ziqulathe amaxesha anyukayo ngokulandelelana, sinokusebenzisa oko ukubonisa uluhlu ngaphakathi kwengqokelela ethile. Sisebenzisa le fomathi: <code style=\"color: blue\">aacid__{collection}__{from_timestamp}--{to_timestamp}</code>, apho amaxesha afakiwe. Oku kuyahambelana ne-ISO 8601 notation. Uluhlu luqhubeka, kwaye lunokungqamanisa, kodwa xa kukho ukungqamanisa kufuneka luqulathe iirekhodi ezifanayo njengaleyo ikhutshwe ngaphambili kule ngqokelela (njengoko ii-AACs zingaguqukiyo). Iirekhodi ezilahlekileyo azivumelekanga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file"
msgstr "<strong>Ifayile yedatha.</strong> Ifayile yedatha iqulathe idatha yoluhlu lwe-AACs, kwengqokelela ethile. Zinezi mpawu zilandelayo:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.filename"
msgstr "Igama lefayile kufuneka libe luluhlu lwe-AACID, elandulelwe ngu <code style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</code> kwaye lilandelwe ngu <code>.jsonl.zstd</code>. Umzekelo, enye yeenkcazelo zethu ibizwa ngokuba<br><code><span style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__zlib3_records__20230808T014342Z--20230808T023702Z</span>.jsonl.zst</code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.jsonlines"
msgstr "Njengoko kubonisiwe sisiphelo sefayile, uhlobo lwefayile yi <a %(jsonlines)s>JSON Lines</a> ecinezelwe nge <a %(zstd)s>Zstandard</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.fields"
msgstr "Into nganye ye-JSON kufuneka iqulathe amasimi alandelayo kwinqanaba eliphezulu: <strong>aacid</strong>, <strong>metadata</strong>, <strong>data_folder</strong> (ngokuzikhethela). Akukho masimi angaphandle avumelekileyo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.metadata"
msgstr "<code>metadata</code> yidatha engacaciswanga, ngokweemeko zengqokelela. Kufuneka ihambelane ngokwasemantiki ngaphakathi kwengqokelela."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.data_folder"
msgstr "<code>data_folder</code> ayinyanzelekanga, kwaye ligama lefolda yedatha yebhayinari equlathe idatha yebhayinari ehambelanayo. Igama lefayile yedatha yebhayinari ehambelanayo ngaphakathi kwaloo folda yi-AACID yerekhodi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.prefix"
msgstr "Isiqalo <code style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</code> sinokulungiswa kwigama lembutho wakho, umzekelo <code style=\"color: red\">my_institute_meta__</code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary"
msgstr "<strong>Ifolda yedatha yebhayinari.</strong> Ifolda enedatha yebhayinari yoluhlu lwe-AACs, kwengqokelela ethile. Zinezi mpawu zilandelayo:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary.name"
msgstr "Igama ledirektori kufuneka libe luluhlu lwe-AACID, elandulelwe ngu <code style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</code>, kwaye akukho siseko. Umzekelo, enye yeenkcazelo zethu inedirektori ebizwa ngokuba<br><code><span style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__zlib3_files__20230808T055130Z--20230808T055131Z</span></code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary.contents"
msgstr "Idirektori kufuneka iqulathe iifayile zedatha kuzo zonke ii-AACs ngaphakathi koluhlu oluchaziweyo. Ifayile nganye yedatha kufuneka ibe ne-AACID yayo njengegama lefayile (akukho zongezo)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary.tip"
msgstr "Kucetyiswa ukwenza ezi folda zibe lula ukulawula ngobukhulu, umzekelo, zingabi ngaphezulu kwe-100GB-1TB nganye, nangona esi sicelo sinokutshintsha ngokuhamba kwexesha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.torrents"
msgstr "<strong>Torrents.</strong> Iifayile ze-metadata kunye neefolda zedatha yebhayinari zinokudityaniswa kwiitorrents, kunye netorrent enye ngefayile yemetadata, okanye itorrent enye ngefolda yedatha yebhayinari. Iitorrents kufuneka zibe negama lefayile/ifolda yokuqala kunye nesihlomelo <code>.torrent</code> njengegama lefayile yazo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.heading"
msgstr "Umzekelo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text1"
msgstr "Masijonge kukhupho lwethu lwakutsha nje lweZ-Library njengomzekelo. Iqulathe iindibaniselwano ezimbini: “<span style=\"background: #fffaa3\">zlib3_records</span>” kunye “<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>”. Oku kusivumela ukuba sikhuphe ngokwahlukeneyo kwaye sikhuphe iirekhodi ze-metadata kwiifayile zeencwadi ezikhoyo. Njengoko kunjalo, sikhuphe iitorrents ezimbini kunye neefayile ze-metadata:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text2"
msgstr "Sikwakhuphe iqela leetorrents kunye neefolda zedatha yebhayinari, kodwa kuphela kwindibaniselwano “<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>”, 62 iyonke:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text3"
msgstr "Ngokuqhuba <code>zstdcat <span style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #fffaa3\">zlib3_records</span>__20230808T014342Z--20230808T023702Z.jsonl.zst</span></code> sinokubona okungaphakathi:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text4"
msgstr "Kule meko, yi-metadata yencwadi njengoko ixelwe yiZ-Library. Kwinqanaba eliphezulu sinayo kuphela “aacid” kunye “metadata”, kodwa akukho “data_folder”, kuba akukho datha yebhayinari ehambelanayo. I-AACID iqulethe “22430000” njenge-ID ephambili, esinokubona ithathwe kwi-“zlibrary_id”. Sinokulindela ezinye ii-AAC kule ndibaniselwano ukuba zibe nesakhiwo esifanayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text5"
msgstr "Ngoku masiqhube <code>zstdcat <span style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z--20230809T223215Z.jsonl.zst</span></code>:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text6"
msgstr "Le yi-metadata ye-AAC encinci kakhulu, nangona ininzi yale AAC ifumaneka kwenye indawo kwifayile yebhayinari! Emva kwayo yonke loo nto, sinayo “data_folder” ngeli xesha, ngoko sinokulindela ukuba idatha yebhayinari ehambelanayo ifumaneke kwi <code><span style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z--20230808T051504Z</span>/<span style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z__22433983__NRgUGwTJYJpkQjTbz2jA3M</span></code>. I-“metadata” iqulethe “zlibrary_id”, ngoko sinokuyidibanisa lula ne-AAC ehambelanayo kwindibaniselwano “zlib_records”. Besinokuyidibanisa ngeendlela ezahlukeneyo, umzekelo nge-AACID — umgangatho awuyaleli oko."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text7"
msgstr "Qaphela ukuba akuyomfuneko ukuba intsimi ye-“metadata” ibe yi-JSON ngokwayo. Inokuba ngumtya oqulethe i-XML okanye naluphi na olunye uhlobo lwedatha. Unokugcina ulwazi lwe-metadata kwi-binary blob ehambelanayo, umzekelo ukuba lulwazi oluninzi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion.heading"
msgstr "Isiphelo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion.text1"
msgstr "Ngalo mgangatho, sinokwenza ukukhutshwa kube ngaphezulu ngokuthe ngcembe, kwaye kube lula ukongeza imithombo emitsha yedatha. Sele sinokukhutshwa okumbalwa okumangalisayo kumgca!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion.text2"
msgstr "Siyathemba ukuba kuya kuba lula nakwezinye iilayibrari ezimnyama ukuba zilingise iindibaniselwano zethu. Emva kwayo yonke loo nto, injongo yethu kukugcina ulwazi kunye nenkcubeko yoluntu ngonaphakade, ngoko ke okukhona kukho ukungafani kokukhona kungcono."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion"
msgstr "- U-Anna kunye neqela (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.title"
msgstr "Uhlaziyo luka-Anna: i-archive evulekileyo ngokupheleleyo, i-ElasticSearch, 300GB+ yeemifanekiso zeencwadi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.tldr"
msgstr "Besisebenza ubusuku nemini ukubonelela ngenye indlela elungileyo nge-Archive ka-Anna. Nazi ezinye zezinto esizifezekisileyo kutshanje."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.text1"
msgstr "NgeZ-Library isihla kunye nabasunguli bayo (abathiwa) babanjwa, besisebenza ubusuku nemini ukubonelela ngenye indlela elungileyo nge-Archive ka-Anna (asiyi kuyidibanisa apha, kodwa ungayikhangela kwiGoogle). Nazi ezinye zezinto esizifezekisileyo kutshanje."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source"
msgstr "I-Archive ka-Anna ivulekile ngokupheleleyo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text1"
msgstr "Sikholelwa ukuba ulwazi kufuneka lukhululeke, kwaye ikhowudi yethu ayikho ngaphandle. Sikhuphe yonke ikhowudi yethu kwi-Gitlab yethu eyamkelwe ngasese: <a %(annas_archive)s>Isoftware ka-Anna</a>. Sikwasebenzisa umkhondo wemiba ukulungelelanisa umsebenzi wethu. Ukuba ufuna ukuzibandakanya nophuhliso lwethu, le yindawo entle yokuqala."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text2"
msgstr "Ukukunika incasa yezinto esisebenza kuzo, thatha umsebenzi wethu wakutsha nje wokuphucula ukusebenza kwicala lomthengi. Kuba asikayifaki iphepha lokuqala, sihlala sibuyisela amaphepha okusesha amade kakhulu, anemiphumo eyi-100-200. Asifuni ukusika iziphumo zokusesha ngokukhawuleza, kodwa oku kuthetha ukuba kuya kucothisa ezinye izixhobo. Kule nto, sifake iqhinga elincinci: siwugubungele uninzi lweziphumo zokusesha kwiingxelo ze-HTML (<code><!-- --></code>), kwaye sibhale iJavascript encinci eya kufumanisa xa isiphumo kufuneka sibonakale, ngelo xesha siya kugubungula ingxelo:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text3"
msgstr "I-DOM \"virtualization\" yenziwe ngemigca engama-23, akukho mfuneko yeelayibrari ezikhethekileyo! Luhlobo lwekhowudi esebenzayo ekhawulezayo oyifumanayo xa unexesha elilinganiselweyo, kunye neengxaki zokwenyani ezidinga ukusonjululwa. Kuxelwe ukuba uphendlo lwethu ngoku lusebenza kakuhle kwizixhobo ezicothayo!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text4"
msgstr "Omnye umzamo omkhulu yayikukwenza ngokuzenzekelayo ukwakha isiseko sedatha. Xa saqalisa, sasidibanisa imithombo eyahlukeneyo ngokungacwangciswanga. Ngoku sifuna ukuyihlaziya, ngoko sabhala inani lezikripthi zokukhuphela i-metadata entsha kwiifolokhwe ezimbini ze-Library Genesis, kwaye siyidibanise. Injongo kukwenza oku kube luncedo kwindawo yethu yogcino, kodwa nokwenza izinto zibe lula kuye nabani na ofuna ukudlala nge-metadata yelayibrari yesithunzi. Injongo iya kuba yincwadi ye-Jupyter enazo zonke iintlobo ze-metadata enomdla ekhoyo, ukuze sikwazi ukwenza uphando oluninzi njengokufumanisa ukuba <a %(blog)s>liphi ipesenti ye-ISBNs egcinwe ngonaphakade</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text5"
msgstr "Ekugqibeleni, siphinde sayilungisa inkqubo yethu yokunikela. Ngoku ungasebenzisa ikhadi letyala ukufaka imali ngqo kwi-wallets yethu ye-crypto, ngaphandle kokufuna ukwazi nantoni na malunga ne-cryptocurrencies. Siza kuqhubeka nokujonga ukuba oku kusebenza kakuhle kangakanani ngokwenyani, kodwa oku kubaluleke kakhulu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es"
msgstr "Tshintshela kwi-ElasticSearch"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.text1"
msgstr "Enye ye-<a %(annas_archive)s>tikiti</a> zethu yayiyingxowa yemiba kunye nenkqubo yethu yokukhangela. Sasisebenzisa i-MySQL full-text search, kuba sasineenkcukacha zethu zonke kwi-MySQL. Kodwa yayinezithintelo zayo:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem1"
msgstr "Ezinye izicelo zathatha ixesha elide kakhulu, ukuya kwinqanaba lokuba zihlutha zonke izihlanganisi ezivulekileyo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem2"
msgstr "Ngokungagqibekanga i-MySQL inobude begama elincinci, okanye isalathiso sakho sinokukhula kakhulu. Abantu baxele ukuba abakwazi ukukhangela \"Ben Hur\"."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem3"
msgstr "Ukukhangela kwakukhawuleza kancinci xa kugcwele ngokupheleleyo kwimemori, nto leyo eyayifuna ukuba sifumane umatshini obiza kakhulu ukuqhuba oku, kunye nemiyalelo ethile yokulayisha kwangaphambili isalathiso ekuqaleni."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem4"
msgstr "Sasingakwazi ukuyandisa lula ukwakha iimpawu ezintsha, ezifana nokwahlulahlula okungcono kweelwimi ezingezizo ezineendawo ezingenanto, ukuhluza/ukwahlula, ukucwangcisa, iziphakamiso \"ngaba uthetha\", ukuzalisa ngokuzenzekelayo, njalo njalo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.text2"
msgstr "Emva kokuthetha neengcali ezininzi, sagqiba kwi-ElasticSearch. Ayizange ibe yinto egqibeleleyo (iziphakamiso zabo ezizenzekelayo \"ngaba uthetha\" kunye neempawu zokuzalisa ngokuzenzekelayo azilunganga), kodwa ngokubanzi ibingcono kakhulu kune-MySQL yokukhangela. Asikayithandi kakhulu ukuyisebenzisa nayiphi na idatha ebalulekileyo (nangona benze inkqubela phambili eninzi), kodwa ngokubanzi siyavuya ngotshintsho."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.text3"
msgstr "Okwangoku, siye sasebenzisa ukukhangela okukhawulezayo kakhulu, inkxaso yolwimi engcono, ukucwangcisa ngokufanelekileyo, iindlela ezahlukeneyo zokucwangcisa, kunye nokuhluza ngohlobo lolwimi/uhlobo lwencwadi/uhlobo lwefayile. Ukuba unomdla wokuba oku kusebenza njani, <a %(annas_archive_l140)s>jonga</a> <a %(annas_archive_l1115)s>apha</a> <a %(annas_archive_l1635)s>kwi</a>. Kuyafikeleleka kakhulu, nangona kungafuna izimvo ezingakumbi…"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers"
msgstr "I-300GB+ yezimbo zomlibo zikhutshwe"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers.text1"
msgstr "Ekugqibeleni, siyavuya ukwazisa ukukhutshwa okuncinci. Ngokusebenzisana nabantu abasebenza ngefolokhwe ye-Libgen.rs, sabelana ngazo zonke izimbo zabo zeencwadi ngeetorrents kunye ne-IPFS. Oku kuya kwenza ukuba umthwalo wokujonga izimbo usasazwe phakathi koomatshini abaninzi, kwaye kuya kugcina ngcono. Kwiimeko ezininzi (kodwa hayi zonke), izimbo zeencwadi zifakwe kwiifayile ngokwazo, ngoko ke oku kuhlobo lwedatha \"eyenziwe\". Kodwa ukuba nayo kwi-IPFS iseyinto eluncedo kakhulu ekusebenzeni kwemihla ngemihla kwe-Anna’s Archive kunye neefolokhwe ezahlukeneyo ze-Library Genesis."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers.text2"
msgstr "Njengesiqhelo, ungayifumana le khululo kwi-Pirate Library Mirror (EDIT: ifuduselwe kwi-<a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a>). Asiyi kuyidibanisa apha, kodwa ungayifumana lula."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers.text3"
msgstr "Sinethemba lokuba singaphumla kancinci, ngoku ukuba sinenye indlela efanelekileyo kwi-Z-Library. Lo msebenzi awuzinzanga ngokukodwa. Ukuba unomdla wokunceda ngeprogramming, ukusebenza kweseva, okanye umsebenzi wokugcina, qhagamshelana nathi. Kusenokuninzi <a %(annas_archive)s>umsebenzi ekufuneka wenziwe</a>. Enkosi ngomdla wakho kunye nenkxaso."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.signature"
msgstr "- U-Anna kunye neqela (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.title"
msgstr "I-Anna’s Archive igcine elona thala leencwadi lesithunzi leencwadi ezihlekisayo elikhulu emhlabeni (95TB) — unokunceda ukusasaza"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.tldr"
msgstr "Elona thala leencwadi lesithunzi leencwadi ezihlekisayo elikhulu emhlabeni lalinephuzu elinye lokusilela.. de kube namhlanje."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.links"
msgstr "<a %(news_ycombinator)s>Xoxa kwi-Hacker News</a>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.text1"
msgstr "Elona thala leencwadi lesithunzi leencwadi ezihlekisayo likhulu kunokwenzeka lefolokhwe ethile ye-Library Genesis: Libgen.li. Umlawuli omnye owayeqhuba le ndawo wakwazi ukuqokelela ingqokelela yeencwadi ezihlekisayo engaphezulu kweefayile ezi-2 ezigidi, iyonke ingaphezulu kwe-95TB. Nangona kunjalo, ngokungafaniyo nezinye iindibano ze-Library Genesis, le yayifumaneka kuphela ngokubanzi ngeetorrents. Unokufikelela kwezi ncwadi ezihlekisayo nganye nganye kuphela ngeserver yakhe yobuqu ecothayo — iphuzu elinye lokusilela. De kube namhlanje!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.text2"
msgstr "Kule posi siza kukuxelela ngakumbi ngale ngqokelela, kunye nomsebenzi wethu wokufumana inkxaso-mali ukuxhasa ngakumbi lo msebenzi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fig1"
msgstr "<q>UDkt. Barbara Gordon uzama ukuzilahlekisa kwihlabathi eliqhelekileyo lelayibrari…</q>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.forks"
msgstr "Iifolokhwe zeLibgen"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.forks.text1"
msgstr "Okokuqala, imvelaphi ethile. Usenokuba uyayazi iLibrary Genesis ngenxa yengqokelela yabo yeencwadi ezinkulu. Bambalwa abantu abazi ukuba amavolontiya eLibrary Genesis adale amanye amaphulo, anjengengqokelela enkulu yamaphephancwadi kunye namaxwebhu asemgangathweni, ugcino olupheleleyo lweSci-Hub (ngentsebenziswano nomseki weSci-Hub, uAlexandra Elbakyan), kwaye eneneni, ingqokelela enkulu yeekhomikhi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.forks.text2"
msgstr "Ngexesha elithile abaqhubi abohlukeneyo beLibrary Genesis mirrors baye bahlukana, nto leyo eyakhokelela kwimeko yangoku yokuba neefolokhwe ezahlukeneyo, zonke zisabambe igama elithi Library Genesis. Ifolokhwe yeLibgen.li inale ngqokelela yeekhomikhi, kunye nengqokelela enkulu yamaphephancwadi (esikwasebenza kuyo)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration"
msgstr "Intsebenziswano"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration.text1"
msgstr "Ngenxa yobukhulu bayo, le ngqokelela ibikwi-list yethu yeminqweno ixesha elide, ngoko emva kwempumelelo yethu yokugcina iZ-Library, sijolise kule ngqokelela. Ekuqaleni sayikhuhla ngqo, eyayiyingxaki enkulu, kuba iseva yabo yayingekho kwimeko entle. Sifumene malunga ne-15TB ngale ndlela, kodwa yayihamba kancinci."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration.text2"
msgstr "Ngethamsanqa, sikwazile ukunxibelelana nomqhubi welayibrari, owavuma ukusithumelela yonke idatha ngqo, eyayikhawuleza kakhulu. Kwathatha ngaphezulu kwesiqingatha sonyaka ukuhambisa kunye nokucubungula yonke idatha, kwaye saphantse sayilahla yonke ngenxa yokonakala kweediski, nto leyo ebeya kuthetha ukuqala kwakhona."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration.text3"
msgstr "Le mava asenze sakholwa ukuba kubalulekile ukufumana le datha ngaphandle ngokukhawuleza okukhulu, ukuze ikwazi ukugcinwa kude nakude. Sisondele kwimeko enye okanye ezimbini ezingenathamsanqa zokulahlekelwa yile ngqokelela ngonaphakade!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection"
msgstr "Ingqokelela"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text1"
msgstr "Ukuhamba ngokukhawuleza kuthetha ukuba ingqokelela ayicwangciswanga kakuhle… Masijonge. Khawube nomfanekiso-ngqondweni wefayilesistim (enyanisweni siyahlula-hlula kwiitorenti):"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text2"
msgstr "Isikhombisi sokuqala, <code>/repository</code>, yinxalenye ecwangciswe ngakumbi yale nto. Esi sikhombisi siqulethe ezibizwa ngokuba “ngamawaka dirs”: izikhombisi nganye enefayile yamawaka, ezibhalwe ngokulandelelana kwidatabase. Isikhombisi <code>0</code> siqulethe iifayile ezine-comic_id 0–999, njalo njalo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text3"
msgstr "Le yinkqubo efanayo neLibrary Genesis esele isebenzisa kwiingqokelela zayo zefiction kunye ne-non-fiction. Umbono kukuba yonke “dir yamawaka” iguqulwe ngokuzenzekelayo ibe yitorenti nje ukuba igcwaliswe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text4"
msgstr "Nangona kunjalo, umqhubi weLibgen.li akazange enze iitorenti zale ngqokelela, ngoko ke amawaka dirs mhlawumbi aba yinkathazo, kwaye anikezela kwi “unsorted dirs”. Ezi ziyi <code>/comics0</code> ukuya <code>/comics4</code>. Zonke ziqulethe izakhiwo zesikhombisi ezizodwa, ezisenokwenziwa ngengqiqo yokuqokelela iifayile, kodwa azisenangqiqo kuthi ngoku. Ngethamsanqa, i-metadata isabhekisa ngqo kuzo zonke ezi fayile, ngoko ke ulungelelwaniso lwazo kwidiski alubalulekanga!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text5"
msgstr "I-metadata ifumaneka ngendlela yedatabase ye-MySQL. Le inokukhutshelwa ngqo kwiwebhusayithi yeLibgen.li, kodwa siza kuyenza ifumaneke kwitorenti, kunye netafile yethu enazo zonke ii-MD5 hashes."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis"
msgstr "Uhlalutyo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.text1"
msgstr "Xa ufumana i-95TB ilahliwe kwiqela lakho lokugcina, uzama ukuqonda ukuba yintoni ekuyo… Senze uhlalutyo ukuze sibone ukuba singayinciphisa kancinci, njengokukhupha izinto eziphindaphindayo. Nazi ezinye zezinto esizifumeneyo:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item1"
msgstr "Iiduplicates zeSemantic (iiskeni ezahlukeneyo zencwadi enye) zinokucocwa ngokwethiyori, kodwa kunzima. Xa sijonga ngesandla kwiikhomikhi sifumene iimpazamo ezininzi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item2"
msgstr "Kukho ezinye iiduplicates ngokwe-MD5 kuphela, ezililize, kodwa ukuzicoca kuya kusinika malunga ne-1% in yokonga. Kule nqanaba oko kuse malunga ne-1TB, kodwa kwakhona, kule nqanaba i-1TB ayibalulekanga. Singathanda ukungathathi mngcipheko wokutshabalalisa idatha ngempazamo kule nkqubo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item3"
msgstr "Sifumene iqela leenkcukacha ezingezizo iincwadi, ezifana neemovie ezisekelwe kwiincwadi zekhomikhi. Oko nako kubonakala kulilize, kuba ezi sele zifumaneka ngokubanzi ngezinye iindlela. Nangona kunjalo, saqonda ukuba asikwazi nje ukucoca iifayile zeemovie, kuba kukho ne <em>iincwadi zekhomikhi ezisebenzisanayo</em> ezakhutshwa kwikhompyutha, ezirekhodwe ngumntu kwaye zagcinwa njengeemovie."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item4"
msgstr "Ekugqibeleni, nantoni na esinokuyicima kwingqokelela iya konga kuphela ipesenti ezimbalwa. Emva koko sakhumbula ukuba singabathandi bedatha, kwaye abantu abaza kuphinda benze oku nabo bangabathandi bedatha, ngoko ke, “UTHINI, CIMA?!” :)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.text2"
msgstr "Ngoko ke sikubonisa ingqokelela epheleleyo, engaguqukiyo. Yidatha eninzi, kodwa sithemba ukuba abantu abaninzi baya kukhathalela ukuyikhulisa nangona kunjalo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser"
msgstr "Umkhankaso wokuqokelela imali"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text1"
msgstr "Sikhupha le datha kwiingceba ezinkulu. I-torrent yokuqala yi <code>/comics0</code>, esiyibeke kwifayile enye enkulu ye-12TB .tar. Oku kungcono kwidrayivu yakho enzima kunye nesoftware ye-torrent kunefayile ezininzi ezincinci."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text2"
msgstr "Njengenxalenye yokukhutshwa, senza umkhankaso wokuqokelela imali. Sijonge ukuqokelela i-$20,000 ukugubungela iindleko zokusebenza kunye nezokuthenga kwesi siqokelelo, kunye nokuvumela iiprojekthi eziqhubekayo nezizayo. Sinazo ezinye <em>ezinkulu</em> ezisendleleni."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text3"
msgstr "<em>Ndixhasa bani ngomnikelo wam?</em> Ngamafutshane: sigcina lonke ulwazi kunye nenkcubeko yoluntu, kwaye siyenza ifikeleleke lula. Lonke ikhowudi yethu kunye nedatha zikhululekile, siyiprojekthi eqhutywa ngokupheleleyo ngabavolontiya, kwaye sigcine i-125TB yeencwadi ukuza kuthi ga ngoku (ngaphandle kwee-torrents ezikhoyo zeLibgen kunye neScihub). Ekugqibeleni sakha i-flywheel evumela kwaye ikhuthaza abantu ukuba bafumane, baskena, kwaye bagcine zonke iincwadi emhlabeni. Siza kubhala ngesicwangciso sethu esikhulu kwiposti ezayo. :)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text4"
msgstr "Ukuba unikele ngelungu le-12 leenyanga “Amazing Archivist” ($780), uya kufumana <strong>“ukwamkela i-torrent”</strong>, okuthetha ukuba siya kubeka igama lakho lomsebenzisi okanye umyalezo kwifayile yegama le-torrent enye!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text5"
msgstr "Unokunikela ngokuhamba uye <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>kwiiArhive zika-Anna</a> kwaye ucofe iqhosha elithi “Nikela”. Sikwajonge abavolontiya abaninzi: iinjineli zesoftware, abaphandi bezokhuseleko, iingcali zorhwebo ezingaziwayo, kunye nabaguquleli. Unokwasixhasa ngokubonelela ngeenkonzo zokubamba. Kwaye kunjalo, nceda ukhuliseni ii-torrents zethu!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text6"
msgstr "Enkosi kubo bonke abasiseke ngentobeko! Niyenza umahluko ngenene."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text7"
msgstr "Nazi ii-torrents ezikhutshiweyo ukuza kuthi ga ngoku (sisasebenza kwezinye):"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text8"
msgstr "Zonke ii-torrents zingafumaneka kwi <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>iiArhive zika-Anna</a> phantsi kwe “Datasets” (asikhonkxi ngqo apho, ukuze amakhonkco kule bhlog angasuswa kwiReddit, Twitter, njl). Ukusuka apho, landela ikhonkco kwiwebhusayithi yeTor."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next"
msgstr "Yintoni elandelayo?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text1"
msgstr "Iqela leetorrents lilungile kugcino lwexesha elide, kodwa alilunganga kakhulu ukufikelela kwemihla ngemihla. Siza kusebenza kunye namaqabane okubamba ukufumana yonke le datha kwiwebhu (ekubeni iiArhive zika-Anna azibambi nto ngqo). Ewe, uya kukwazi ukufumana la makhonkco okukhuphela kwiArhive zika-Anna."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text2"
msgstr "Sikwamema wonke umntu ukuba enze izinto ngale datha! Sincede siyihlalutye ngcono, siyiphinde-phinde, siyibeke kwi-IPFS, siyixube, uqeqeshe iimodeli zakho ze-AI ngayo, njalo njalo. Konke okwakho, kwaye asikwazi kulinda ukubona into oyenzayo ngayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text3"
msgstr "Ekugqibeleni, njengoko besitshilo ngaphambili, sisenezinye izikhutshwa ezinkulu ezizayo (ukuba <em>umntu</em> angathumela <em>ngempazamo</em> isixa sedatha ye <em>ethile</em> ye-ACS4, uyazi apho usifumana khona…), kunye nokwakha i-flywheel yokugcina zonke iincwadi emhlabeni."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text4"
msgstr "Ngoko hlala ubukele, sisandula ukuqala."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.signature"
msgstr "- U-Anna kunye neqela (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.title"
msgstr "Iincwadi ezintsha ezi-3 zongezwe kwiPirate Library Mirror (+24TB, iincwadi ezi-3.8 ezigidi)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text1"
msgstr "Kukhutshwa kwantlandlolo kwePirate Library Mirror (EDIT: kufuduselwe kwi <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>iiArhive zika-Anna</a>), senze isibuko seZ-Library, ingqokelela enkulu yeencwadi ezingekho mthethweni. Njengesikhumbuzo, oku kukwabhala kwethu kwiposti yebhlog yantlandlolo:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.q1.text1"
msgstr "I-Z-Library yithala leencwadi elidumileyo (kwaye elingekho mthethweni). Bathathe ingqokelela yeLibrary Genesis kwaye bayenza ifumaneke lula. Ngaphezu koko, baye baba nefuthe elikhulu ekufumaneni igalelo leencwadi ezintsha, ngokukhuthaza abasebenzisi abaninzi ngeenzuzo ezahlukeneyo. Okwangoku abanikeli ezi ncwadi zintsha kwiLibrary Genesis. Kwaye ngokungafaniyo neLibrary Genesis, abenzi ingqokelela yabo ifumaneke lula, nto leyo ethintela ukugcinwa okubanzi. Oku kubalulekile kwimodeli yabo yeshishini, kuba bahlawulisa imali yokufikelela kwingqokelela yabo ngobuninzi (ngaphezulu kweencwadi ezili-10 ngosuku)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.q1.text2"
msgstr "Asikuko sithatha izigqibo zokuziphatha malunga nokuhlawulisa imali ukufikelela kwincwadi ezingekho mthethweni. Akukho mathandabuzo ukuba iZ-Library ibe yimpumelelo ekwandiseni ukufikelela kulwazi, nasekufumaneni iincwadi ezininzi. Silapha nje ukwenza indima yethu: ukuqinisekisa ukugcinwa kwexesha elide kwesi siqokelelo sabucala."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text2"
msgstr "Esi siqokelelo sasingowephakathi ku-2021. Okwangoku, iZ-Library ikhula ngesantya esothusayo: bongeze malunga neencwadi ezintsha eziyi-3.8 yezigidi. Kukho ezinye eziphindaphindwayo apho, ewe, kodwa uninzi lwazo lubonakala luyincwadi ezintsha ngokusemthethweni, okanye iikopi ezikumgangatho ophezulu zeencwadi ezazifakwe ngaphambili. Oku kungenxa enkulu yenani elandayo labalawuli abazithandela kwiZ-Library, kunye nenkqubo yabo yokulayisha ngobuninzi enokuphinda-phinda. Sifuna ukubabulela ngale mpumelelo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text3"
msgstr "Siyavuya ukwazisa ukuba sifumene zonke iincwadi ezongezwe kwiZ-Library phakathi kwesipili sethu sokugqibela nango-Agasti 2022. Sibuyele umva kwaye sakhangela ezinye iincwadi esaziphosa okokuqala. Konke konke, esi siqokelelo sitsha singama-24TB, esikhulu kakhulu kunesokugqibela (7TB). Isipili sethu ngoku singama-31TB iyonke. Kwakhona, siphinde saphinda-phinda ngokuchasene neLibrary Genesis, kuba sele kukho iitorenti ezifumanekayo kweso siqokelelo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text4"
msgstr "Nceda uye kwiPirate Library Mirror ukuze ujonge esi siqokelelo sitsha (EDIT: sishenxisiwe kwi <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a>). Kukho ulwazi olungakumbi apho malunga nendlela iifayile ezakhiwe ngayo, kunye nento etshintshileyo ukusukela ngexesha lokugqibela. Asiyi kuyidibanisa apha, kuba le yibhlog yewebhusayithi engabambi naziphi na izinto ezingekho mthethweni."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text5"
msgstr "Ngokuqinisekileyo, ukutshala iitorenti nako kuyindlela entle yokusinceda. Enkosi kubo bonke abathumela iitorenti zethu zangaphambili. Siyabulela impendulo entle, kwaye siyavuya ukuba baninzi abantu abanomdla wokugcina ulwazi nenkcubeko ngale ndlela engaqhelekanga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.signature"
msgstr "- U-Anna kunye neqela (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.title"
msgstr "Indlela yokuba ngumgcini weencwadi ongumqolomba"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.tldr"
msgstr "Umngeni wokuqala unokumangalisa. Ayingomcimbi wezobuchwepheshe, okanye umcimbi wezomthetho. Ngumcimbi wengqondo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.updates"
msgstr "Ngaphambi kokuba singene ngaphakathi, iindaba ezimbini kwiPirate Library Mirror (EDIT: sishenxisiwe kwi <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a>):"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.updates.item1"
msgstr "Sifumene iminikelo enobubele kakhulu. Eyokuqala yayiyi-$10k evela kumntu ongaziwayo owayekwangumncedisi \"bookwarrior\", umseki wokuqala weLibrary Genesis. Enkosi ngokukhethekileyo ku-bookwarrior ngokuncedisa le minikelo. Eyesibini yayiyi-$10k enye evela kumnikeli ongaziwayo, owasinceda emva kokukhutshwa kwethu kokugqibela, kwaye wakhuthazwa ukuba ancede. Sikwafumene inani leminikelo emincinci. Enkosi kakhulu ngenkxaso yenu enobubele. Sineeprojekthi ezintsha ezinomdla eziza kuxhaswa yile, ngoko hlala ubukele."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.updates.item2"
msgstr "Sibe neengxaki zobuchwepheshe ngobukhulu bokukhutshwa kwethu kwesibini, kodwa iitorenti zethu ziphakanyisiwe kwaye ziyasasazwa ngoku. Sikwafumene isithembiso esinobubele kumntu ongaziwayo sokusasaza isiqokelelo sethu kwiiseva zabo ezinesantya esiphezulu kakhulu, ngoko ke sisenza ulayisho olukhethekileyo kumatshini wabo, emva koko wonke umntu okhuphela isiqokelelo kufuneka abone ukuphucuka okukhulu kwisantya."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.text1"
msgstr "Iincwadi ezipheleleyo zinokubhalwa malunga ne <em>kutheni</em> kokugcinwa kwedijithali ngokubanzi, kunye nokugcinwa kweencwadi ezingekho mthethweni ngokukodwa, kodwa masinike isifundo esikhawulezayo kwabo bangaziyo kakhulu. Ihlabathi likhupha ulwazi nenkcubeko engakumbi kunangaphambili, kodwa kwakhona uninzi lwayo luyalahleka kunangaphambili. Uluntu luthenjwa kakhulu kwiinkampani ezifana nabapapashi bezemfundo, iinkonzo zokusasaza, kunye neenkampani zemidiya yoluntu ngeli lifa, kwaye bahlala bengabonakali njengabaphathi abakhulu. Jonga idokhumentari ethi Digital Amnesia, okanye naliphi na intetho kaJason Scott."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.text2"
msgstr "Kukho amaziko athile enza umsebenzi omhle wokugcina kangangoko banako, kodwa abotshelelwe ngumthetho. Njengamaqolomba, sikwindawo ekhethekileyo yokugcina iinqokelelo abangakwazi ukuzichukumisa, ngenxa yokunyanzeliswa kwamalungelo obunini okanye ezinye izithintelo. Sikwakwazi ukujonga iinqokelelo amaxesha amaninzi, kwihlabathi liphela, ngaloo ndlela sikhulisa amathuba okugcinwa ngokufanelekileyo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.text3"
msgstr "Okwangoku, asizukungena kwiingxoxo malunga neenzuzo kunye neengozi zamalungelo obunini, ukuziphatha kokwaphula umthetho, iingcinga zokucinezela, okanye umba wokufikelela kulwazi nenkcubeko. Ngako konke oko kuphumile endleleni, masingene kwi <em>indlela</em>. Siza kwabelana ngendlela iqela lethu elaba ngamaqolomba, kunye nezifundo esizifundileyo endleleni. Kukho imingeni emininzi xa uqala olu hambo, kwaye sinethemba lokuba singakunceda kwezinye zazo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community"
msgstr "Uluntu"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text1"
msgstr "Umngeni wokuqala unokumangalisa. Ayingomcimbi wezobuchwepheshe, okanye umcimbi wezomthetho. Ngumcimbi wengqondo: ukwenza lo msebenzi emthunzini kunokuba yinto enesizungu kakhulu. Kuxhomekeke kwinto ocwangcisa ukuyenza, kunye nemodeli yakho yosongelo, unokufuna ukuba ulumke kakhulu. Kwelinye icala lesikali sinabantu abanjengoAlexandra Elbakyan*, umseki weSci-Hub, ovulelekileyo kakhulu malunga nemisebenzi yakhe. Kodwa uphantsi komngcipheko omkhulu wokubanjwa ukuba angatyelela ilizwe lasentshona ngeli xesha, kwaye angajongana neminyaka emininzi entolongweni. Ngaba loo mngcipheko ungathanda ukuwuthatha? Sikwelinye icala lesikali; silumke kakhulu ukuba singashiyi naluphi na umkhondo, kwaye sibe nokhuseleko oluqinileyo lokusebenza."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text2"
msgstr "* Njengoko kuchaziwe kwi-HN ngu \"ynno\", uAlexandra ekuqaleni wayengafuni ukwaziwa: \"Iiseva zakhe zazimiswe ukuba zikhuphe imiyalezo yephutha eneenkcukacha ezivela kwi-PHP, kubandakanya indlela epheleleyo yefayile yomthombo ephazamisayo, eyayiphantsi kwefolda /home/ringo-ring, enokulandelwa kwigama lomsebenzisi awayenalo kwi-intanethi kwindawo engahambelaniyo, edityaniswe negama lakhe lokwenyani. Ngaphambi kokuba le ngxelo ibonakale, wayengaziwa.\" Ngoko ke, sebenzisa amagama omsebenzisi angahleliwe kwiikhompyutha ozisebenzisayo kule nto, hleze ulungise into engalunganga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text3"
msgstr "Ukufihla, nangona kunjalo, kuza nentlawulo yengqondo. Uninzi lwabantu luthanda ukuqatshelwa ngomsebenzi abawenzayo, kwaye awukwazi ukuthatha naliphi na igalelo kulo ebomini bokwenyani. Nokuba izinto ezilula zinokuba ngumngeni, njengabahlobo abakubuza ukuba ubusenza ntoni (ngesinye isihlandlo \"ukudlala ngeNAS yam / homelab\" kuyadika)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text4"
msgstr "Yiyo loo nto kubaluleke kakhulu ukufumana uluntu. Unokunciphisa ukhuseleko lokusebenza ngokuthembela kubahlobo abasondeleyo kakhulu, obaziyo ukuba unokubathemba kakhulu. Nokuba kunjalo lumka ungabeki nto ebhaliweyo, hleze kufuneka banikezele nge-imeyile yabo kubaphathi, okanye ukuba izixhobo zabo ziye zaphazamiseka ngenye indlela."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text5"
msgstr "Kungcono ukufumana abanye abaqolomba. Ukuba abahlobo bakho abasondeleyo banomdla wokuzimanya nawe, kulungile! Ngaphandle koko, unokukwazi ukufumana abanye kwi-intanethi. Ngelishwa oku kuseyiluntu oluncinci. Okwangoku sifumene inani elincinci labanye abasebenza kule ndawo. Iindawo ezilungileyo zokuqala zibonakala ngathi ziiforamu zeLibrary Genesis, kunye ne-r/DataHoarder. Iqela leArchive nalo linezinto ezifanayo, nangona lisebenza ngaphakathi komthetho (nokuba kwezinye iindawo ezingwevu zomthetho). Iindawo zemveli \"warez\" kunye neendawo zokuphangela nazo zineengcinga ezifanayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text6"
msgstr "Sivuleleke kwiingcamango zokukhuthaza uluntu kunye nokuhlola iingcamango. Zive ukhululekile ukusithumelela umyalezo kuTwitter okanye kuReddit. Mhlawumbi singabamba uhlobo oluthile lweforum okanye iqela lokuncokola. Umngeni omnye kukuba oku kunokucinywa lula xa kusetyenziswa amaqonga aqhelekileyo, ngoko ke kuya kufuneka sikubambe thina ngokwethu. Kukwakho nokutshintshiselana phakathi kokuba nezi ngxoxo zibe sesidlangalaleni ngokupheleleyo (ukuzibandakanya okungakumbi) xa kuthelekiswa nokwenza kube ngasese (kungavumeli \"iithagethi\" ezinokubakho zazi ukuba siza kuzikhuhla). Kuya kufuneka sicinge ngoko. Sazise ukuba unomdla koku!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects"
msgstr "Iiprojekthi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.text1"
msgstr "Xa senze iprojekthi, inamanyathelo ambalwa:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase1"
msgstr "Ukukhethwa kwendawo / ifilosofi: Uthanda ukugxila phi, kwaye kutheni? Ziziphi izinto ozithandayo, izakhono, kunye neemeko ezizodwa onokuzisebenzisa ukuze uzuze?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase2"
msgstr "Ukukhethwa kwethagethi: Yeyiphi ingqokelela ethile oza kuyilinganisela?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase3"
msgstr "Ukukhuhla metadata: Ukurekhoda ulwazi malunga neefayile, ngaphandle kokuzikhuphela ngokwazo (ezihlala zikhulu kakhulu)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase4"
msgstr "Ukukhethwa kwedatha: Ngokusekelwe kwimetadata, ukunciphisa ukuba yeyiphi idatha ebaluleke kakhulu ukugcinwa ngoku. Inokuba yiyo yonke into, kodwa rhoqo kukho indlela efanelekileyo yokugcina isithuba kunye nebandwidth."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase5"
msgstr "Ukukhuhla idatha: Ngokwenene ukufumana idatha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase6"
msgstr "Ukuhanjiswa: Ukupakisha kwiitorenti, ukuyibhengeza kwenye indawo, ukufumana abantu ukuba bayisasaze."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.text2"
msgstr "La manyathelo awazimeleyo ngokupheleleyo, kwaye rhoqo izimvo ezivela kwinqanaba elilandelayo zikubuyisela kwinqanaba elidlulileyo. Umzekelo, ngexesha lokukhuhla metadata unokufumanisa ukuba ithagethi oyikhethileyo inemilinganiselo yokuzikhusela engaphaya kwezakhono zakho (njengezithintelo ze-IP), ngoko ke ubuyele umva kwaye ufumane ithagethi eyahlukileyo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain"
msgstr "1. Ukukhethwa kwendawo / ifilosofi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.text1"
msgstr "Akukho kunqongophala kolwazi kunye nelifa lenkcubeko elinokugcinwa, elinokubangela ukuxinana. Kungenxa yoko le nto kuhlala kuluncedo ukuthatha umzuzu ucinge malunga nento onokuyinceda."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.text2"
msgstr "Wonke umntu unendlela eyahlukileyo yokucinga ngale nto, kodwa nantsi eminye imibuzo onokuzibuza yona:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.why"
msgstr "Kutheni unomdla koku? Yintoni oyithandayo? Ukuba singafumana iqela labantu ababhala izinto abazikhathaleleyo ngokukodwa, oko kungagubungela okuninzi! Uya kwazi okuninzi kunomntu ophakathi malunga nomdla wakho, njengedatha ebalulekileyo yokugcina, zeziphi ezona ngqokelela kunye neendawo zoluntu ezikwi-intanethi, njalo njalo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.skills"
msgstr "Zeziphi izakhono onazo onokuzisebenzisa ukuze uzuze? Umzekelo, ukuba ungumgqatswa wezokhuseleko kwi-intanethi, unokufumana iindlela zokoyisa izithintelo ze-IP kwiithagethi ezikhuselekileyo. Ukuba ulungile ekuququzeleleni uluntu, mhlawumbi unokuhlanganisa abantu abathile malunga nenjongo. Kuyanceda ukwazi inkqubo ethile yokubhala, nokuba nje kukugcina ukhuseleko olulungileyo lokusebenza kulo lonke le nkqubo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.time"
msgstr "Unexesha elingakanani koku? Ingcebiso yethu iya kuba kukuqala kancinci kwaye wenze iiprojekthi ezinkulu njengoko uqhelana nayo, kodwa inokuthatha lonke ixesha lakho."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.target"
msgstr "Yeyiphi indawo enokuthi ibe nefuthe eliphezulu yokugxila kuyo? Ukuba uza kuchitha iiyure ze-X ekugcineni iincwadi ezivela kwiindawo ezingekho mthethweni, ngoko ke ungayifumana njani eyona \"nxalenye\" inkulu?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.thinking"
msgstr "Zeziphi iindlela ezizodwa ozicinga ngazo? Unokuba neengcamango okanye iindlela ezinomdla abanye abanokuthi baphoswe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.text3"
msgstr "Kwimeko yethu, sasikhathalele ngokukodwa ukugcinwa kwexesha elide kwesayensi. Sasazi ngeLibrary Genesis, kwaye yayilinganiswe ngokupheleleyo amaxesha amaninzi kusetyenziswa iitorenti. Sasiluthanda olo luvo. Emva koko ngenye imini, omnye wethu wazama ukufumana ezinye iincwadi zesayensi kwiLibrary Genesis, kodwa akazifumananga, ebeka amathandabuzo malunga nokuba igqibelele kangakanani. Saza sakhangela ezo ncwadi kwi-intanethi, sazifumana kwezinye iindawo, nto leyo eyatyala imbewu yeprojekthi yethu. Nandipha phambi kokuba sazi ngeZ-Library, sasinesicwangciso sokungazami ukuqokelela zonke ezo ncwadi ngesandla, kodwa ukugxila ekulinganiseni iinqokelela ezikhoyo, kwaye sizibuyisele kwiLibrary Genesis."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target"
msgstr "2. Ukukhethwa kwethagethi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.text1"
msgstr "Ke, sinendawo yethu esijonge kuyo, ngoku yeyiphi ingqokelela ethile esiza kuyilingisa? Kukho izinto ezimbalwa ezenza ukuba ibe yindawo efanelekileyo:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.large"
msgstr "Inkulu"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.unique"
msgstr "Eyodwa: engagutyungelwanga kakuhle ngamanye amaphulo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.accessible"
msgstr "Ifikeleleka: ayisebenzisi amanqanaba amaninzi okhuseleko ukuthintela ukuba ungakhangeli metadata kunye nedatha yabo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.insight"
msgstr "Ulwazi olukhethekileyo: unolwazi olukhethekileyo malunga nale ndawo, njengokuba unokufikelela ngokukhethekileyo kule ngqokelela, okanye ufumanise indlela yokoyisa ukhuseleko lwabo. Oku akufuneki (iphulo lethu elizayo alenzi nto ikhethekileyo), kodwa ngokuqinisekileyo kuyanceda!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.text2"
msgstr "Xa safumana iincwadi zethu zesayensi kwiwebhusayithi ezingezizo i-Library Genesis, sazama ukuqonda indlela ezafika ngayo kwi-intanethi. Saza safumana i-Z-Library, saqonda ukuba nangona uninzi lweencwadi zingaqali ukubonakala apho, ziya kugqibela zifike apho. Safunda ngobudlelwane bayo ne-Library Genesis, kunye nesakhiwo semivuzo (yemali) kunye nomsebenzisi ongcono, zombini ezenza ukuba ibe yingqokelela epheleleyo ngakumbi. Saza senze ukhangelo lwe-metadata kunye nedatha, saqonda ukuba sinokujikeleza imida yokukhuphela ye-IP yabo, sisebenzisa ukufikelela okukhethekileyo komnye wamalungu ethu kwiiseva ezininzi ze-proxy."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.text3"
msgstr "Njengoko uphonononga iindawo ezahlukeneyo, kubalulekile ukuzenza ungabonakali ngokusebenzisa ii-VPN kunye needilesi ze-imeyile ezilahliweyo, esiza kuthetha ngazo ngakumbi kamva."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata"
msgstr "3. Ukukhupha i-Metadata"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text1"
msgstr "Masibe nobuchule ngakumbi apha. Ukukhupha ngokwenene i-metadata kwiwebhusayithi, sigcine izinto zilula. Sisebenzisa izikripthi zePython, ngamanye amaxesha i-curl, kunye nesiseko sedatha se-MySQL ukugcina iziphumo. Asikasebenzisi software yokukhupha ephambili enokuthi imephu iwebhusayithi ezinzima, kuba ukuza kuthi ga ngoku besifuna ukukhupha uhlobo olunye okanye ezimbini zamaphepha ngokulandelelana kwee-ids kunye nokuhlalutya i-HTML. Ukuba akukho maphepha alula alandelelanayo, unokufuna umkhweli ofanelekileyo ozama ukufumana onke amaphepha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text2"
msgstr "Phambi kokuba uqale ukukhupha iwebhusayithi yonke, zama ukuyenza ngesandla okomzuzwana. Hamba kumaphepha ambalwa ngokwakho, ukuze ufumane umbono wokuba oko kusebenza njani. Ngamanye amaxesha uya kudibana ne-IP blocks okanye ezinye iindlela ezinomdla ngale ndlela. Kuyafana nakwi-data scraping: ngaphambi kokuba ungene nzulu kule ndawo, qiniseka ukuba unokukhuphela idatha yayo ngokufanelekileyo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text3"
msgstr "Ukuba ujikeleza izithintelo, kukho izinto ezimbalwa onokuzama. Ngaba zikhona ezinye iidilesi ze-IP okanye iiseva ezibamba idatha efanayo kodwa azinazo izithintelo ezifanayo? Ngaba zikhona iindawo ze-API ezinganazo izithintelo, ngelixa ezinye zinazo? Ngawaphi amaxabiso okukhuphela apho i-IP yakho ivaliwe, kwaye ixesha elingakanani? Okanye awuvaliwe kodwa uyacothiswa? Kuthekani ukuba wenza iakhawunti yomsebenzisi, izinto zitshintsha njani ke? Ungasebenzisa i-HTTP/2 ukugcina unxibelelwano luvulekile, kwaye oko kuyandisa isantya sokucela amaphepha? Ngaba kukho amaphepha adwelisa iifayile ezininzi ngaxeshanye, kwaye ulwazi oludweliswe apho luyanelisa?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text4"
msgstr "Izinto onokufuna ukuzigcina ziquka:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.title"
msgstr "Isihloko"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.location"
msgstr "Ifayile / indawo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.id"
msgstr "ID: inokuba yi-ID yangaphakathi, kodwa ii-ID ezifana ne-ISBN okanye i-DOI ziyanceda kakhulu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.size"
msgstr "Ubukhulu: ukubala ukuba ungakanani indawo yediski oyifunayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.hash"
msgstr "I-Hash (md5, sha1): ukuqinisekisa ukuba ukhuphele ifayile ngokuchanekileyo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.dates"
msgstr "Umhla wongezwe/uhlaziywe: ukuze ubuye kamva ukhuphele iifayile ongazikhuphelanga ngaphambili (nangona unokusebenzisa i-ID okanye i-hash ngale njongo)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.notes"
msgstr "Inkcazo, udidi, iithegi, ababhali, ulwimi, njl."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text5"
msgstr "Ngokuqhelekileyo sikwenzela oku kwinqanaba elibini. Okokuqala sikhuphela iifayile ze-HTML ezingekacocwa, ngokuqhelekileyo ngqo kwi-MySQL (ukuphepha iifayile ezininzi ezincinci, esithetha ngazo ngakumbi ngezantsi). Emva koko, kwinyathelo elahlukileyo, sihamba kwezo fayile ze-HTML kwaye sizihlalutye kwiitafile ze-MySQL ezisebenzayo. Ngale ndlela akufuneki ukhuphele yonke into kwakhona ukuba ufumanisa impazamo kwikhowudi yakho yokuhlalutya, kuba unokuphinda usebenze iifayile ze-HTML ngekhowudi entsha. Kukwakhona lula ukwahlula inqanaba lokucubungula, ngaloo ndlela ugcine ixesha (kwaye unokubhala ikhowudi yokucubungula ngelixa ukukhupha kuqhuba, endaweni yokuba ubhale zombini amanyathelo ngaxeshanye)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text6"
msgstr "Okokoko, qaphela ukuba kwezinye iinjongo, ukukrala metadata kuphela yinto ekhoyo. Kukho iintlobo ezinkulu zeemetadata phaya ezingagcinwanga kakuhle."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data"
msgstr "4. Ukukhetha idatha"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data.text1"
msgstr "Rhoqo ungasebenzisa i-metadata ukufumanisa iseti yedatha efanelekileyo yokukhuphela. Nokuba ekugqibeleni ufuna ukukhuphela yonke idatha, kunokuba luncedo ukunika ingqwalasela kwizinto ezibaluleke kakhulu kuqala, hleze ubhaqwe kwaye ukhuseleko luphuculwe, okanye kuba ungafuna ukuthenga iidiski ezingakumbi, okanye nje kuba kukho enye into ephazamisayo ebomini bakho ngaphambi kokuba ukwazi ukukhuphela yonke into."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data.text2"
msgstr "Umzekelo, ingqokelela inokuba neenguqulelo ezininzi zesixhobo esifanayo (njenge ncwadi okanye ifilimu), apho enye ibonakaliswe njengomgangatho ophezulu. Ukugcina ezo nguqulelo kuqala kunengqiqo enkulu. Ekugqibeleni ungafuna ukugcina zonke iinguqulelo, kuba kwezinye iimeko i-metadata inokuba ithegiwe ngokungalunganga, okanye kungabakho ukungaziwa phakathi kweenguqulelo (umzekelo, \"inguqulelo engcono\" inokuba ngcono ngeendlela ezininzi kodwa ingabi ngcono kwezinye iindlela, njengokuthi ifilimu ibe nesigqibo esiphezulu kodwa ingenazo izihlokwana)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data.text3"
msgstr "Ungaphinda ukhangele kwisiseko sedatha yakho ye-metadata ukufumana izinto ezinomdla. Yeyiphi ifayile enkulu kakhulu ebibanjwe, kwaye kutheni inkulu kangaka? Yeyiphi ifayile encinci kakhulu? Ngaba kukho iipateni ezinomdla okanye ezingalindelekanga xa kufikwa kwiindidi ezithile, iilwimi, njalo njalo? Ngaba kukho izihloko eziphindaphindayo okanye ezifanayo kakhulu? Ngaba kukho iipateni xa idatha yongezwa, njengosuku olunye apho iifayile ezininzi zongezwa ngaxeshanye? Rhoqo ungafunda lukhulu ngokujonga iseti yedatha ngeendlela ezahlukeneyo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data.text4"
msgstr "Kwimeko yethu, sikhuphe iincwadi zeZ-Library ngokuchasene ne-md5 hashes kwi-Library Genesis, ngaloo ndlela sigcina ixesha elininzi lokukhuphela kunye nendawo yediski. Le yimeko eyodwa kakhulu nangona kunjalo. Kwiimeko ezininzi akukho zisiseko sedatha ezibanzi zokuba zeziphi iifayile ezigcinwe kakuhle ngabanye abaphangi. Oku ngokwalo lithuba elikhulu kumntu othile phaya. Kuya kuba kuhle ukuba neenkcazelo ezihlaziywa rhoqo zezinto ezifana nomculo kunye neefilimu ezisele zisasazwa kakhulu kwiwebhusayithi ze-torrent, kwaye ke ngoko zisezantsi kwinqanaba lokubaluleka lokufakwa kwiipirate mirrors."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping"
msgstr "5. Ukukrala idatha"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text1"
msgstr "Ngoku ulungele ukukhuphela idatha ngobuninzi. Njengoko kukhankanyiwe ngaphambili, ngeli xesha kufuneka sele ukhuphele ngesandla iifayile ezininzi, ukuze uqonde ngcono indlela yokuziphatha kunye nezithintelo zento ekujoliswe kuyo. Nangona kunjalo, kusenokubakho izimanga ezikulindileyo xa sele ufikelele ekukhupheleni iifayile ezininzi ngaxeshanye."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text2"
msgstr "Ingcebiso yethu apha ikakhulu kukugcina izinto zilula. Qala ngokukhuphela nje iifayile ezininzi. Ungasebenzisa iPython, kwaye emva koko wandise kwiithridi ezininzi. Kodwa ngamanye amaxesha kulula ngakumbi ukuvelisa iifayile zeBash ngokuthe ngqo kwisiseko sedatha, kwaye emva koko usebenzise ezininzi zazo kwiifestile ezininzi zetheminali ukuze wandise. Iqhinga lobugcisa elikhawulezayo elifanele ukukhankanywa apha kukusebenzisa i-OUTFILE kwi-MySQL, onokuyibhala naphi na ukuba ucima \"secure_file_priv\" kwi-mysqld.cnf (kwaye uqinisekise ukuba ucima/uyigqithise i-AppArmor ukuba usebenzisa iLinux)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text3"
msgstr "Sigcina idatha kwiidiski ezilula. Qala ngento onayo, kwaye wandise kancinci. Kunokuba nzima ukucinga ngokugcina amakhulu e-TB yedatha. Ukuba le yimeko ojongene nayo, bhengeza iseti elungileyo kuqala, kwaye kwisaziso sakho cela uncedo ekugcineni okuseleyo. Ukuba ufuna ukufumana iidiski ezinzima ngokwakho, ke i-r/DataHoarder inezixhobo ezilungileyo zokufumana izivumelwano ezilungileyo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text4"
msgstr "Zama ukungakhathazeki kakhulu ngeefayile ezikhethekileyo. Kulula ukuwela kumngxuma wokumisela izinto ezifana ne-ZFS. Enye into yobugcisa ekufuneka uyazi nangona kunjalo, kukuba iifayile ezininzi aziphathwa kakuhle ziifayile ezininzi. Sifumene ukuba indlela elula yokuyijongana nayo kukudala iindawo ezininzi, umzekelo, kwiindawo ezahlukeneyo ze-ID okanye iiprefiksi zehashi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text5"
msgstr "Emva kokukhuphela idatha, qiniseka ukuba ujonge ukuthembeka kweefayile usebenzisa iihashi kwi-metadata, ukuba zikhona."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution"
msgstr "6. Ukuhanjiswa"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text1"
msgstr "Unedatha, ngaloo ndlela unokubamba isibuko sokuqala se-pirate sehlabathi se-target yakho (mhlawumbi). Kwiindlela ezininzi inxalenye enzima kakhulu iphelile, kodwa inxalenye enobungozi isekho phambi kwakho. Emva kwayo yonke loo nto, ukuza kuthi ga ngoku ubusenza ngasese; ubhabha phantsi kwe-radar. Konke obekufuneka ukwenze kukusebenzisa i-VPN elungileyo ngalo lonke ixesha, ungazalisi iinkcukacha zakho zobuqu nakweyiphi na ifomu (duh), kwaye mhlawumbi usebenzisa iseshoni yesikhangeli esikhethekileyo (okanye ikhompyutha eyahlukileyo)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text2"
msgstr "Ngoku kufuneka usasaze idatha. Kwimeko yethu sifuna kuqala ukunikela ngeencwadi kwi-Library Genesis, kodwa saza safumanisa kunzima oko (ukwahlula phakathi kweentsomi kunye nezingezizo iintsomi). Ke sagqiba ekubeni sabelane sisebenzisa i-torrents ezinjenge-Library Genesis. Ukuba unethuba lokunikela kwiprojekthi esele ikho, oko kungakugcinela ixesha elininzi. Nangona kunjalo, azikho iipirate mirrors ezicwangcisiweyo kakuhle phaya okwangoku."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text3"
msgstr "Ke masithi ugqiba ekubeni usasaze i-torrents ngokwakho. Zama ukugcina ezo fayile zincinci, ukuze kube lula ukuzibeka kwiwebhusayithi ezahlukeneyo. Uya kufuneka ube ngulowo utyala i-torrents ngokwakho, ngelixa usahlala ungaziwa. Ungasebenzisa i-VPN (ngenxa okanye ngaphandle kokuthumela phambili izibuko), okanye uhlawule ngee-Bitcoins ezityhidiweyo kwi-Seedbox. Ukuba awazi ukuba ezinye zezi magama zithetha ntoni, uya kuba nomsebenzi wokufunda, kuba kubalulekile ukuba uqonde iingozi zokutshintshiselana apha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text4"
msgstr "Ungabamba iifayile ze-torrent ngokwazo kwiwebhusayithi ze-torrent ezikhoyo. Kwimeko yethu, sikhethe ukubamba iwebhusayithi, kuba sifuna nokusasaza ifilosofi yethu ngendlela ecacileyo. Ungayenza le nto ngokwakho ngendlela efanayo (sisebenzisa i-Njalla kwiidomain zethu kunye nokubamba, kuhlawulwa ngee-Bitcoins ezityhidiweyo), kodwa uzive ukhululekile ukuqhagamshelana nathi ukuze sibambe i-torrents zakho. Sijonge ukwakha isalathiso esibanzi se-pirate mirrors ngokuhamba kwexesha, ukuba le mbono iyathandwa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text5"
msgstr "Malunga nokukhetha i-VPN, sele kubhalwe kakhulu ngale nto, ngoko siza kuphinda nje ingcebiso ngokubanzi yokukhetha ngokudumileyo. Iipolisi zokungena ezingenazo iirekhodi ezivavanyiweyo zenkundla ezineerekhodi ezinde zokukhusela ubumfihlo zezona zinto zisezantsi zomngcipheko, ngokoluvo lwethu. Qaphela ukuba nokuba wenza yonke into ngokuchanekileyo, awusoze ufikelele kumngcipheko ongenanto. Umzekelo, xa utyala i-torrents zakho, umenzi wehlabathi onomdla kakhulu unokujonga ukuhamba kwedatha engenayo nephumayo kwiiseva ze-VPN, kwaye afumanise ukuba ungubani. Okanye unokwenza impazamo nje. Mhlawumbi sele senze, kwaye siza kwenza kwakhona. Ngethamsanqa, amazwe awakhathali <em>kakhulu</em> malunga nokuphanga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text6"
msgstr "Esinye isigqibo sokwenza kwiprojekthi nganye, kukuba uyipapashe usebenzisa isazisi esifanayo njengangaphambili, okanye hayi. Ukuba uqhubeka usebenzisa igama elifanayo, ke iimpazamo zokhuseleko olusebenzayo kwiiprojekthi zangaphambili zinokubuya zikulume. Kodwa ukupapasha phantsi kwamagama ahlukeneyo kuthetha ukuba awakhi igama elide elihlala ixesha elide. Sikhethe ukuba nokhuseleko olomeleleyo olusebenzayo ukusuka ekuqaleni ukuze sikwazi ukuqhubeka sisebenzisa isazisi esifanayo, kodwa asiyi kuthandabuza ukupapasha phantsi kwegama elahlukileyo ukuba senze impazamo okanye ukuba iimeko zifuna oko."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text7"
msgstr "Ukufumana igama kunokuba nzima. Njengoko sitshilo, oku kuseyindawo encinci. Saqala ukupapasha kwiReddit, kodwa saza safumana impumelelo kwiHacker News. Okwangoku ingcebiso yethu kukuyipapasha kwiindawo ezimbalwa kwaye ubone ukuba kwenzeka ntoni. Kwaye kwakhona, qhagamshelana nathi. Siza kuthanda ukusasaza igama lezinye iinzame zokugcina iipirate."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.conclusion"
msgstr "Isiphelo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.conclusion.text1"
msgstr "Siyathemba ukuba oku kuyanceda kubagcini beencwadi abasaqalayo. Siyavuya ukukwamkela kweli hlabathi, ngoko ungathandabuzi ukunxibelelana nathi. Masigcine ulwazi nenkcubeko yehlabathi kangangoko sinako, kwaye siyisasaze kude nakude."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.signature"
msgstr "- U-Anna kunye neqela (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.title"
msgstr "Sazisa iPirate Library Mirror: Ukugcina i-7TB yeencwadi (ezingekho kwiLibgen)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text1"
msgstr "Le projekthi (EDIT: ifuduselwe kwi <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>I-Archive ka-Anna</a>) ijolise ekuncedeni ukugcinwa nokukhululwa kolwazi lwabantu. Senza igalelo lethu elincinci nelithobekileyo, silandela ezinyathelweni zabakhulu abaphambi kwethu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text2"
msgstr "Ugxininiso lweprojekthi lukhonjiswa ligama layo:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.focus.pirate"
msgstr "<strong>Pirate</strong> - Siphula umthetho we-copyright ngamabom kumazwe amaninzi. Oku kusivumela ukuba senze into engekwazi ukwenziwa ngamacandelo asemthethweni: ukuqinisekisa ukuba iincwadi zisakazwa kude nakude."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.focus.library"
msgstr "<strong>Library</strong> - Njengeelabhulali ezininzi, sigxile ikakhulu kwizinto ezibhaliweyo ezifana neencwadi. Sinokwandisa kwezinye iintlobo zemidiya kwixesha elizayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.focus.mirror"
msgstr "<strong>Mirror</strong> - Siyisibuko esingqongqo seelabhulali ezikhoyo. Sigxile ekugcineni, hayi ekwenzeni iincwadi zifumaneke lula kwaye zikhutshelwe (ukufikelela) okanye ekukhuliseni uluntu olukhulu lwabantu abangenisa iincwadi ezintsha (ukufumana)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text3"
msgstr "Ilabhulali yokuqala esiyisibukileyo yi-Z-Library. Le yindawo edumileyo (kwaye engekho mthethweni) yelabhulali. Bathathe ingqokelela ye-Library Genesis kwaye bayenza ifumaneke lula. Ngaphezu koko, baye baba nefuthe elikhulu ekufumaneni iincwadi ezintsha, ngokukhuthaza abasebenzisi abangenisa ngeenzuzo ezahlukeneyo. Okwangoku abangenisi ezi ncwadi zintsha kwi-Library Genesis. Kwaye ngokungafaniyo ne-Library Genesis, abenzi ingqokelela yabo ifumaneke lula, nto leyo ethintela ukugcinwa okubanzi. Oku kubalulekile kumzekelo weshishini labo, kuba bahlawulisa imali yokufikelela kwengqokelela yabo ngobuninzi (ngaphezulu kweencwadi ezili-10 ngosuku)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text4"
msgstr "Asikuko sithatha izigqibo zokuziphatha malunga nokuhlawulisa imali ukufikelela kwincwadi ezingekho mthethweni. Akukho mathandabuzo ukuba iZ-Library ibe yimpumelelo ekwandiseni ukufikelela kulwazi, nasekufumaneni iincwadi ezininzi. Silapha nje ukwenza indima yethu: ukuqinisekisa ukugcinwa kwexesha elide kwesi siqokelelo sabucala."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text5"
msgstr "Sifuna ukukumema ukuba uncede ukugcina nokukhulula ulwazi lwabantu ngokukhuphela nokusasaza iitorenti zethu. Jonga iphepha leprojekthi ngolwazi oluthe vetshe malunga nendlela ulwazi olucwangciswe ngayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text6"
msgstr "Sikwanemema kakhulu ukuba ungenise izimvo zakho malunga neengqokelela ezilandelayo zokubukisa, kunye nendlela yokwenza oko. Sisonke sinokufezekisa okuninzi. Oku kungumnikelo omncinci phakathi kwabanye abaninzi. Enkosi, ngako konke okwenzayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.signature"
msgstr "- U-Anna kunye neqela (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.footnote"
msgstr "<em>Asidibanisi kwiifayile ezivela kule bhlogi. Nceda uzifumane ngokwakho.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.title"
msgstr "Ukukhutshwa kwe-ISBNdb, okanye Zingaphi Iincwadi Ezikhuselweyo Ngonaphakade?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.tldr"
msgstr "Ukuba besiza kuphinda sikhuphe iifayile kwiilabhulali ezimnyama, liphi ipesenti yeencwadi zonke ehlabathini esizigcinileyo?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text1"
msgstr "NgePirate Library Mirror (EDIT: ifuduselwe kwi <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>I-Archive ka-Anna</a>), injongo yethu kukuthatha zonke iincwadi ehlabathini, kwaye sizigcine ngonaphakade.<sup>1</sup> Phakathi kwee-torrents zethu ze-Z-Library, kunye nee-torrents zokuqala ze-Library Genesis, sinazo iifayile ezili-11,783,153. Kodwa zingaphi ezo, ngokwenene? Ukuba besiza kuphinda sikhuphe ezo fayile, liphi ipesenti yeencwadi zonke ehlabathini esizigcinileyo? Sifuna ngokwenene ukuba nento enje:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.10%"
msgstr "10% of ilifa elibhaliweyo loluntu ligcinwe ngonaphakade"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text2"
msgstr "Ukuba ipesenti, sifuna isahlulelo: inani elipheleleyo leencwadi ezakha zapapashwa.<sup>2</sup> Phambi kokuphela kweGoogle Books, injineli kule projekthi, uLeonid Taycher, <a %(booksearch_blogspot)s>wazama ukulinganisa</a> eli nani. Wafikelela — ngentetho ehlekisayo — kwi-129,864,880 (“ubuncinci de kube ngeCawa”). Walilinganisa eli nani ngokwakha isiseko sedatha esidibeneyo seencwadi zonke ehlabathini. Kule nto, wadibanisa iDatasets ezahlukeneyo waza wazidibanisa ngeendlela ezahlukeneyo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text3"
msgstr "Njengokuphambuka okusheshayo, kukhona omunye umuntu owayezama ukubhalisa zonke izincwadi emhlabeni: u-Aaron Swartz, umkhankaso wedijithali ongasekho kanye nomsunguli we-Reddit.<sup>3</sup> Waqala <a %(youtube)s>i-Open Library</a> ngenhloso yokuthi “ikhasi lewebhu elilodwa leyo ncwadi esake yashicilelwa”, ehlanganisa idatha evela emithonjeni eminingi ehlukene. Wagcina ekhokhe inani eliphezulu ngomsebenzi wakhe wokulondoloza idijithali lapho ebhekene necala lokulanda izincwadi zesayensi ngobuningi, okuholele ekuzibulaleni kwakhe. Akudingeki ukusho, lokhu kungenye yezizathu iqembu lethu elisebenzisa amagama angamanga, futhi kungani siqaphela kakhulu. I-Open Library isaqhutshwa ngokumangalisayo ngabantu e-Internet Archive, iqhubeka nefa lika-Aaron. Sizobuyela kulokhu kamuva kulesi sikhala."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text4"
msgstr "Kumhlahlandlela we-Google, u-Taycher uchaza ezinye zezinselelo zokulinganisa leli nani. Okokuqala, yini eyenza incwadi? Kukhona izincazelo ezimbalwa ezingaba khona:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.maybe.copies"
msgstr "<strong>Amakhophi omzimba.</strong> Ngokusobala lokhu akusizi kakhulu, njengoba kuyizinkomba eziphindaphindwayo zezinto ezifanayo. Kungaba kuhle uma singakwazi ukulondoloza zonke izichasiselo abantu abazenza ezincwadini, njengokubhala okudumile kuka-Fermat “emaphethelweni”. Kodwa-ke, lokho kuzohlala kuyiphupho lomlondolozi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.maybe.works"
msgstr "<strong>“Imisebenzi”.</strong> Isibonelo “uHarry Potter kanye neChamber of Secrets” njengomqondo onengqondo, ohlanganisa zonke izinguqulo zawo, njengokuhumusha okuhlukene nokushicilelwa kabusha. Lokhu kuyincazelo ewusizo, kodwa kungaba nzima ukudweba umugqa wokuthi yini efaneleka. Isibonelo, mhlawumbe sifuna ukulondoloza ukuhumusha okuhlukene, nakuba ukushicilelwa kabusha okunezinguquko ezincane kungase kungabalulekile kangako."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.maybe.editions"
msgstr "<strong>“Izinguqulo”.</strong> Lapha ubala yonke inguqulo eyingqayizivele yencwadi. Uma kukhona okwehlukile ngayo, njengokuhlukile kwesembozo noma isandulelo esihlukile, kubhekwa njengenye inguqulo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.maybe.files"
msgstr "<strong>Amafayela.</strong> Uma usebenza nezincwadi ezimnyama njenge-Library Genesis, i-Sci-Hub, noma i-Z-Library, kukhona okunye okucatshangelwayo. Kungaba nezinsimbi eziningi zenguqulo efanayo. Futhi abantu bangakha izinguqulo ezingcono zamafayela akhona, ngokuskena umbhalo usebenzisa i-OCR, noma ukulungisa amakhasi askenwe ngama-engeli. Sifuna ukubala la mafayela njengenye inguqulo, okuzodinga i-metadata enhle, noma ukuhlanganiswa kusetshenziswa izilinganiso zokufana kwamadokhumenti."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text5"
msgstr "“Izinguqulo” kubonakala kuyincazelo esebenzayo kakhulu yokuthi “izincwadi” ziyini. Ngokufanelekile, le ncazelo isetshenziswa futhi ekunikezeni izinombolo ze-ISBN ezihlukile. I-ISBN, noma i-International Standard Book Number, ivame ukusetshenziswa kwezohwebo zamazwe ngamazwe, njengoba ihlanganiswe nohlelo lwe-barcode lwamazwe ngamazwe (”International Article Number”). Uma ufuna ukuthengisa incwadi ezitolo, idinga i-barcode, ngakho uthola i-ISBN."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text6"
msgstr "Isihloko sika-Taycher sikhuluma ukuthi nakuba ama-ISBN ewusizo, awawona wonke, njengoba amukelwa ngempela kuphela maphakathi nawo-1970, futhi hhayi yonke indawo emhlabeni. Nokho, i-ISBN mhlawumbe iyisikhombi esisetshenziswa kakhulu sezinguqulo zezincwadi, ngakho-ke iyisiqalo sethu esingcono kakhulu. Uma singathola wonke ama-ISBN emhlabeni, sithola uhlu oluwusizo lwezincwadi ezisadinga ukulondolozwa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text7"
msgstr "Ngakho-ke, sithola kuphi idatha? Kukhona imizamo eminingana ekhona ezama ukuhlanganisa uhlu lwezincwadi zonke emhlabeni:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.google"
msgstr "<strong>Google.</strong> Ngemuva kwakho konke, benza lolu cwaningo lwe-Google Books. Nokho, i-metadata yabo ayitholakali ngobuningi futhi kunzima ukuyikhipha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.openlib"
msgstr "<strong>Open Library.</strong> Njengoba kushiwo ngaphambili, lokhu kuyinjongo yabo yonke. Bathole inani elikhulu ledatha yelabhulali evela kumalabhulali asebenzisanayo kanye nezinqolobane zikazwelonke, futhi baqhubeka nokwenza njalo. Banababhali bezincwadi abazithandayo kanye nethimba lobuchwepheshe elizama ukuhlanganisa amarekhodi, futhi libhalele ngazo zonke izinhlobo ze-metadata. Okungcono kakhulu, i-dataset yabo ivulekile ngokuphelele. Ungayilanda kalula <a %(openlibrary)s>lapha</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.worldcat"
msgstr "<strong>WorldCat.</strong> Leli yiwebhusayithi eqhutshwa yi-OCLC engenzi nzuzo, ethengisa izinhlelo zokuphatha izincwadi. Bahlanganisa i-metadata yezincwadi ezivela kumalabhulali amaningi, futhi bayenza itholakale ngewebhusayithi ye-WorldCat. Nokho, benza imali ngokuthengisa le datha, ngakho-ke ayitholakali ngokulanda ngobuningi. Banamanye ama-datasets amancane atholakalayo okulanda, ngokubambisana namalabhulali athile."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.isbndb"
msgstr "<strong>ISBNdb.</strong> Lesi yisihloko salokhu okuthunyelwe kwebhulogi. I-ISBNdb ikhipha amawebhusayithi ahlukahlukene ukuze athole i-metadata yezincwadi, ikakhulukazi idatha yamanani, abayithengisa kubathengisi bezincwadi, ukuze bakwazi ukubiza izincwadi zabo ngokuhambisana nemakethe. Njengoba ama-ISBN esevame kakhulu kulezi zinsuku, bakhe ngempumelelo “ikhasi lewebhu leyo ncwadi”."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.ils"
msgstr "<strong>Izinhlelo ezihlukene zamalabhulali nezinqolobane.</strong> Kukhona amalabhulali nezinqolobane ezingakahlaziywa futhi zihlanganiswe nganoma yiziphi ezingenhla, ngokuvamile ngenxa yokuthi azixhaswanga kahle, noma ngezinye izizathu azifuni ukwabelana ngedatha yazo ne-Open Library, i-OCLC, i-Google, njalonjalo. Eziningi zalezi zineziqopha-dijithali ezitholakala nge-inthanethi, futhi zivame ukungavikelwa kahle, ngakho uma ufuna ukusiza futhi ujabulele ukufunda ngezinhlelo zamalabhulali ezingajwayelekile, lezi zindawo ziqala kahle."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text8"
msgstr "Kulesi sikhala, siyajabula ukumemezela ukukhishwa okuncane (uma kuqhathaniswa nokukhishwa kwethu kwe-Z-Library kwangaphambilini). Sikhiphe iningi le-ISBNdb, futhi senze idatha itholakale ukuze ilandwe kuwebhusayithi ye-Pirate Library Mirror (EDIT: yathuthelwa ku-<a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a>; asizukuyixhumanisa lapha ngqo, vele uyifune). Lezi zirekhodi ezingaba ngu-30.9 million (20GB njenge-<a %(jsonlines)s>JSON Lines</a>; 4.4GB gzipped). Kuwebhusayithi yabo bathi empeleni banerekhodi ezingama-32.6 million, ngakho-ke kungenzeka ukuthi sithole okuthile, noma <em>bona</em> benza okuthile okungalungile. Noma kunjalo, okwamanje ngeke sabelane ngokuthi sikwenze kanjani — sizokushiya lokho njengomsebenzi womfundi. ;-)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text9"
msgstr "Esizokwenza ukwabelana ngemininingwane yokuqala, ukuzama ukusondela ekulinganiseni inani lezincwadi emhlabeni. Sibheke ama-datasets amathathu: le dataset entsha ye-ISBNdb, ukukhishwa kwethu kwasekuqaleni kwe-metadata esikhiphe ku-Z-Library shadow library (okuhlanganisa i-Library Genesis), kanye ne-Open Library data dump."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text10"
msgstr "Ake siqale ngamanani alinganiselwe:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text11"
msgstr "Kuzo zombili i-Z-Library/Libgen ne-Open Library kunezincwadi eziningi kakhulu kune-ISBNs ezihlukile. Ingabe lokho kusho ukuthi izincwadi eziningi azinawo ama-ISBN, noma i-metadata ye-ISBN ilahlekile nje? Singaphendula lo mbuzo ngokuhlanganiswa okuzenzakalelayo okusekelwe kwezinye izici (isihloko, umbhali, umshicileli, njll), ukuheha eminye imithombo yedatha, nokukhipha ama-ISBN kuskena kwencwadi uqobo (esimweni se-Z-Library/Libgen)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text12"
msgstr "Mangaki kulawo ma-ISBN ahlukile? Lokhu kuvezwa kahle nge-Venn diagram:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text13"
msgstr "Ukuze sibe ncamashi:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text14"
msgstr "Sasothuka kukuncipha kokuhambelana okukhona! I-ISBNdb inenani elikhulu lama-ISBN angaveli ku-Z-Library noma ku-Open Library, futhi okufanayo kuyasebenza (ngokuncane kodwa okubalulekile) kwezinye ezimbili. Lokhu kuvusa imibuzo eminingi emisha. Ukufanisa okuzenzakalelayo kungasiza kangakanani ekubekeni izincwadi ezingazange zibekwe ngama-ISBN? Ngabe kuzoba nokufaniswa okuningi futhi ngaleyo ndlela kube nokuhambelana okwandisiwe? Futhi, kuzokwenzekani uma siletha i-dataset yesi-4 noma yesi-5? Sizobona ukuhambelana okungakanani ngaleso sikhathi?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text15"
msgstr "Lokhu kusinika iphuzu lokuqala. Manje singabheka wonke ama-ISBN angazange abe ku-dataset ye-Z-Library, futhi angafani nezinkambu zesihloko/umbhali. Lokho kungasinika indlela yokugcina zonke izincwadi emhlabeni: okokuqala ngokukhipha imininingwane ku-inthanethi ngezithombe, bese sihamba empilweni yangempela ukuyoskena izincwadi. Lokhu kungase kusekelwe ngabantu abaningi, noma kuqhutshwe \"imivuzo\" evela kubantu abafisa ukubona izincwadi ezithile ziguqulwa zibe yidijithali. Konke lokho kuyindaba yesikhathi esihlukile."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text16"
msgstr "Uma ufuna ukusiza nganoma yini yalokhu — ukuhlaziya okwengeziwe; ukukhipha metadata eyengeziwe; ukuthola izincwadi eziningi; i-OCR'ing yezincwadi; ukwenza lokhu kwezinye izindawo (isb. amaphepha, izincwadi ezilalelwayo, ama-movie, izinhlelo zethelevishini, omagazini) noma ngisho nokwenza eminye yale datha itholakale ezintweni ezifana nokuqeqeshwa kwe-ML / imodeli yolimi enkulu — sicela uxhumane nami (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text17"
msgstr "Uma unentshisekelo ekutheni ukuhlaziya idatha, sisebenza ekwenzeni ama-datasets ethu nezikripthi zitholakale ngendlela elula yokusebenzisa. Kuzoba kuhle uma ungavele uthathe i-notebook bese uqala ukudlala ngalokhu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text18"
msgstr "Ekugcineni, uma ufuna ukusekela lo msebenzi, sicela ucabangele ukwenza umnikelo. Lokhu kuyinqubo ephethwe ngokuphelele ngabavolontiya, futhi umnikelo wakho wenza umehluko omkhulu. Yonke into iyasiza. Okwamanje sithatha iminikelo nge-crypto; bheka ikhasi le-Donate ku-Archive ka-Anna."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.signature"
msgstr "- U-Anna kunye neqela (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.fn1"
msgstr "1. Ngencazelo ethile enengqondo ye-\"phakade\". ;)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.fn2"
msgstr "2. Vele, ifa elibhaliwe lesintu lingaphezu kwezincwadi, ikakhulukazi kulezi zinsuku. Ngenxa yalokhu okuthunyelwe kanye nokukhishwa kwethu kwakamuva sigxile ezincwadini, kodwa izintshisekelo zethu zidlulela phambili."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.fn3"
msgstr "3. Kuningi okungashiwo ngo-Aaron Swartz, kodwa sifuna ukumkhuluma kafushane, njengoba edlala indima ebalulekile kule ndaba. Njengoba isikhathi sihamba, abantu abaningi bangase bahlangabezane negama lakhe okokuqala, futhi bangene emgodini we-rabbit ngokwabo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.title"
msgstr "Iwindi elibalulekile lamathala ezincwadi angaphansi komthunzi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.tldr"
msgstr "Singasho kanjani ukuthi sigcina amaqoqo ethu kuze kube phakade, uma esesondela ku-1 PB?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.links"
msgstr "<a %(critical_window_chinese)s>Inguqulo yesiShayina 中文版</a>, xoxa ku-<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(news_ycombinator)s>Hacker News</a>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.text1"
msgstr "Ku-Archive ka-Anna, sivame ukubuzwa ukuthi singasho kanjani ukuthi sigcina amaqoqo ethu kuze kube phakade, uma usayizi ophelele ususondela ku-1 Petabyte (1000 TB), futhi usakhula. Kulesi sihloko sizobheka ifilosofi yethu, futhi sibone ukuthi kungani ishumi leminyaka elizayo libalulekile emsebenzini wethu wokugcina ulwazi namasiko esintu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.fig1"
