#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.text4"
msgstr "Ezinye zezi zinto zahluke kakhulu kwezinye ukuze sikhathazeke ngazo (okanye sele zikhathalelwe ngamanye amaziko), ezifana nedatha yendalo okanye idatha yejografi. Kodwa uninzi lwezinto ezikolu luhlu zibalulekile kuthi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.text5"
msgstr "Enye into enkulu ekubekweni phambili kwethu kukuba umsebenzi othile usengozini kangakanani. Sithanda ukugxila kwimisebenzi eyi:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.rarity.rare"
