#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.text6"
msgstr "Ekugqibeleni, siyakhathalela isikali. Sinexesha nemali elinganiselweyo, ngoko sithanda ukuchitha inyanga sisindisa iincwadi ezili-10,000 kunokuba iincwadi ezili-1,000 — ukuba zilingana ngokuxabiseka kwaye zisengozini."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib"
msgstr "Iithala leencwadi ezimnyama"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text1"
msgstr "Zininzi iiorganizations ezinemishini efanayo, kunye nezinto eziphambili ezifanayo. Ewe, kukho iithala leencwadi, iiarhente, iilabhoratri, iimyuziyam, kunye namanye amaziko anikwe uxanduva lokugcinwa kolu hlobo. Uninzi lwazo luxhaswa kakuhle, ngurhulumente, ngabantu ngabanye, okanye ngamashishini. Kodwa zineendawo ezinkulu ezingaboniyo: inkqubo yezomthetho."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text2"
msgstr "Apha kuvela indima ekhethekileyo yeethala leencwadi ezimnyama, kunye nesizathu sokuba iArhive ka-Anna ikhona. Singenza izinto ezingenakwenziwa ngamanye amaziko. Ngoku, akusoloko kunjalo ukuba sinokugcina izinto ezingekho mthethweni ukugcina kwenye indawo. Hayi, kumazwe amaninzi kusemthethweni ukwakha i-arhive enazo naziphi na iincwadi, amaphepha, iimagazini, njalo njalo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text3"
msgstr "Kodwa into engekho rhoqo kwiindawo zokugcina ezisemthethweni kukuphindaphindwa kunye nobomi obude. Kukho iincwadi apho ikopi enye kuphela ikhona kwithala leencwadi elithile. Kukho iirekhodi zetadata ezigcinwe yinkampani enye. Kukho amaphephandaba agcinwe kuphela kwi-microfilm kwindawo enye yokugcina. Iithala leencwadi zinokuncitshiswa inkxaso-mali, iinkampani zinokungabinamali, iindawo zokugcina zinokudutyulwa kwaye zitshiswe. Oku akuyongcinga nje — oku kwenzeka rhoqo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text4"
msgstr "Into esinokuyenza ngokukodwa kwi-Archive ka-Anna kukugcina iikopi ezininzi zemisebenzi, ngobuninzi. Singaqokelela amaphepha, iincwadi, amaphephancwadi, nokunye, size sizisasaze ngobuninzi. Okwangoku sisenza oku ngeetorrents, kodwa itekhnoloji ethile ayibalulekanga kwaye iya kutshintsha ngokuhamba kwexesha. Eyona nto ibalulekileyo kukufumana iikopi ezininzi zisasazwa kwihlabathi liphela. Le ntetho evela kwiminyaka engaphezu kwama-200 edlulileyo isavakala iyinyani:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.quote.the-lost"
msgstr "<em><q>Okulahlekileyo akunakufunyanwa; kodwa masigcine okuseleyo: hayi ngee-vaults kunye nezitshixo ezibathintelayo emehlweni oluntu nasekusebenziseni, ngokubanikezela kumgqibelo wexesha, kodwa ngokuphindaphindwa kweekopi, eziza kubabeka ngaphandle kokufikelela kwengozi.</q></em><br>— Thomas Jefferson, 1791"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text5"
msgstr "Inqaku elifutshane malunga nommandla woluntu. Njengoko i-Archive ka-Anna igxile ngokukodwa kwimisebenzi engavumelekanga kwiindawo ezininzi kwihlabathi liphela, asikhathazeki ngeengqokelela ezifumaneka ngokubanzi, ezifana neencwadi zommandla woluntu. Amaziko asemthethweni ahlala esenza kakuhle oko. Nangona kunjalo, kukho izinto ezithile ezibangela ukuba ngamanye amaxesha sisebenze kwiingqokelela ezifumaneka esidlangalaleni:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.example.metadata"
msgstr "Iirekhodi zetadata zinokujongwa simahla kwiwebhusayithi ye-Worldcat, kodwa azinakukhutshelwa ngobuninzi (de sibe <a %(worldcat_scrape)s>sizikrazule</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.example.github"
msgstr "Ikhowudi ingaba yinkqubo evulekileyo kwi-Github, kodwa i-Github iyonke ayinakukopishwa lula kwaye igcinwe (nangona kule meko kukho iikopi ezisasazekileyo ngokwaneleyo zezona ndawo zininzi zekhowudi)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.example.reddit"
msgstr "I-Reddit isimahla ukuyisebenzisa, kodwa kutshanje ibeke amanyathelo aqinileyo okuchasa ukukrazula, ngenxa yokulamba kwedatha koqeqesho lwe-LLM (okunye malunga noku kamva)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.copies"
msgstr "Ukuphindaphindwa kweekopi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.copies.text1"
msgstr "Sibuyele kumbuzo wethu wokuqala: singathi njani ukuba sigcina iingqokelela zethu ngonaphakade? Ingxaki ephambili apha kukuba ingqokelela yethu iye <a %(torrents_stats)s>yakhula</a> ngesantya esikhawulezayo, ngokukrazula kunye nokuvula ezinye iingqokelela ezinkulu (ngaphezulu komsebenzi omangalisayo owenziwe ngamanye amathala eencwadi ezivulekileyo ezifana ne-Sci-Hub kunye ne-Library Genesis)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.copies.text2"
msgstr "Le nkqubela phambili yedatha yenza kube nzima ukuba iingqokelela zifanelekwe kwihlabathi liphela. Ukugcinwa kwedatha kubiza imali eninzi! Kodwa siyathemba, ngakumbi xa sijonga ezi ndlela zintathu zilandelayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.low-hanging-fruit"
msgstr "1. Siphumelele iziqhamo eziphantsi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.low-hanging-fruit.text1"
msgstr "Le ilandela ngokuthe ngqo kwizinto eziphambili esizixoxileyo ngasentla. Sithanda ukusebenza ekukhululeni iingqokelela ezinkulu kuqala. Ngoku ukuba siqinisekisile ezinye zeengqokelela ezinkulu kwihlabathi, silindele ukuba ukukhula kwethu kube kancinci."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.low-hanging-fruit.text2"
msgstr "Kusekho umgca omde weengqokelela ezincinci, kwaye iincwadi ezintsha ziyaskenwa okanye zipapashwa yonke imihla, kodwa isantya siza kuba kancinci. Singaphinda siphindaphinde okanye sithathe ixesha elide, kodwa ngexesha elide."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage"
msgstr "2. Iindleko zokugcina ziyaqhubeka nokwehla ngokukhawuleza"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text1"
msgstr "Ngexesha lokubhala, <a %(diskprices)s>amaxabiso ediski</a> nge-TB ajikeleze i-$12 kwiidiski ezintsha, i-$8 kwiidiski ezisetyenzisiweyo, kunye ne-$4 kwiteyiphu. Ukuba siyakuthobela kwaye sijonge kuphela kwiidiski ezintsha, oko kuthetha ukuba ukugcina i-petabyte kubiza malunga ne-$12,000. Ukuba sicinga ukuba ithala leencwadi lethu liza kuphindaphinda ukusuka kwi-900TB ukuya kwi-2.7PB, oko kuya kuthetha i-$32,400 yokufanisa ithala leencwadi lethu lonke. Ukongeza umbane, iindleko zezinye izixhobo, njalo njalo, masiyijikeleze kwi-$40,000. Okanye ngeteyiphu ngathi i-$15,000–$20,000."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text2"
msgstr "Ngakolunye uhlangothi <strong>i-$15,000–$40,000 yexabiso lolwazi lonke loluntu iyintengiso</strong>. Ngakolunye uhlangothi, kuyabiza ukulindela iitoni zeekopi ezigcweleyo, ngakumbi ukuba siza kufuna ukuba abo bantu baqhubeke nokukhupha iitorrents zabo ukuze kuncede abanye."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text3"
msgstr "Oko kukule mihla. Kodwa inkqubela phambili iyaqhubeka:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text4"
msgstr "Iindleko zediski ezinzima nge-TB ziye zancitshiswa malunga nesiqingatha kwiminyaka eli-10 edlulileyo, kwaye ziya kuqhubeka nokwehla ngesantya esifanayo. Iteyiphu ibonakala ikwi-trajectory efanayo. Amaxabiso e-SSD ayawa ngokukhawuleza, kwaye anokuthatha amaxabiso e-HDD ekupheleni kweshumi leminyaka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.hdd-prices"
msgstr "Iindlela zamaxabiso e-HDD ezivela kwimithombo eyahlukeneyo (cofa ukuze ubone isifundo)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text5"
msgstr "Ukuba oku kuyenzeka, ke kwiminyaka eli-10 sinokujonga kuphela i-$5,000–$13,000 yokufanisa ingqokelela yethu yonke (1/3), okanye nangaphantsi ukuba sikhula kancinci. Nangona iseyimali eninzi, oku kuya kufikeleleka kubantu abaninzi. Kwaye kunokuba ngcono ngakumbi ngenxa yento elandelayo…"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density"
msgstr "3. Ukuphuculwa kokuxinana kolwazi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text1"
msgstr "Okwangoku sigcina iincwadi kwiifomathi ezingekacocwa njengoko zinikwe kuthi. Ewe, zicuthwe, kodwa rhoqo zisengamakhasi amakhulu okanye iifoto zamaphepha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text2"
msgstr "Ukuza kuthi ga ngoku, iindlela ezikhoyo zokunciphisa ubungakanani bokuqokelela kwethu zibe kukucuthwa okungqongqo ngakumbi, okanye ukususwa kokuphindaphinda. Nangona kunjalo, ukufumana ukonga okukhulu, zombini zilahlekelwa kakhulu ngokweemfuno zethu. Ukucuthwa okukhulu kweefoto kunokwenza umbhalo ungafundeki kakuhle. Kwaye ukususwa kokuphindaphinda kufuna ukuzithemba okuphezulu kweencwadi ezifanayo, nto leyo engachanekanga rhoqo, ngakumbi ukuba umxholo uyafana kodwa iiskeni zenziwe ngamaxesha ahlukeneyo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text3"
msgstr "Kwakuhlala kukho ukhetho lwesithathu, kodwa umgangatho walo wawumbi kangangokuba asizange siluqwalasele: <strong>OCR, okanye Optical Character Recognition</strong>. Le yinkqubo yokuguqula iifoto zibe ngumbhalo ococekileyo, ngokusebenzisa i-AI ukufumanisa oonobumba kwiifoto. Izixhobo zoku zikhona ixesha elide, kwaye zibe zilungile, kodwa \"zilungile\" akonelanga ngeenjongo zokugcina."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text4"
msgstr "Nangona kunjalo, iimodeli zokufunda ezinzulu ezinemisebenzi emininzi ziye zenza inkqubela phambili ekhawulezayo kakhulu, nangona zisabiza kakhulu. Silindele ukuba zombini ukuchaneka kunye neendleko ziya kuphucuka kakhulu kwiminyaka ezayo, ukuya kwinqanaba apho kuya kuba yinyani ukuyisebenzisa kulo lonke uluhlu lwethu lweencwadi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.ocr"
msgstr "Ukuphuculwa kwe-OCR."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text5"
msgstr "Xa oko kwenzeka, sisenokugcina iifayile zokuqala, kodwa ukongeza sinokuba nohlobo oluncinci kakhulu lwencwadi yethu eninzi abantu abaza kufuna ukuyikhuphela. Into emangalisayo kukuba umbhalo ococekileyo uqobo ulungiswa kakuhle ngakumbi, kwaye kulula kakhulu ukususa ukuphindaphinda, kusinika ukonga ngakumbi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text6"
msgstr "Ngokubanzi akuyonyani ukulindela ukuncitshiswa okungenani kwe-5-10x kubungakanani befayile iyonke, mhlawumbi nangaphezulu. Nokuba ngukuncitshiswa okungama-5x, siza kujonga <strong>$1,000–$3,000 kwiminyaka eli-10 nokuba uluhlu lwethu lwencwadi luphindwe kathathu</strong>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window"
msgstr "Ifestile ebalulekileyo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text1"
msgstr "Ukuba ezi ziqikelelo zichanekile, <strong>sifuna nje ukulinda iminyaka embalwa</strong> ngaphambi kokuba lonke uluhlu lwethu lwencwadi lukhutshelwe ngokubanzi. Ngoko ke, ngamazwi kaThomas Jefferson, \"kubekwe ngaphandle kokufikelela kwengozi.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text2"
msgstr "Ngelishwa, ukuvela kwe-LLMs, kunye noqeqesho lwazo olufuna idatha eninzi, kubeke abaninimfanelo abaninzi ekukhuseleni. Ngaphezu koko babesele benjalo. Iindawo ezininzi zewebhu zenza kube nzima ukukrwelela nokugcina, amatyala aphaphazela, kwaye ngelixa iilayibrari zomzimba kunye neearchive ziyaqhubeka nokungahoywa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text3"
msgstr "Singalindela kuphela ukuba ezi ndlela ziyaqhubeka nokuba mbi, kwaye imisebenzi emininzi ilahleke ngaphambi kokuba ingene kwindawo yoluntu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text4"
msgstr "<strong>Sikwiqela lotshintsho ekugcinweni, kodwa <q>okulahlekileyo akunakufunyanwa.</q></strong> Sinexesha elibalulekileyo malunga neminyaka emi-5-10 apho kusekho iindleko eziphezulu zokusebenza ilayibrari emnyama kunye nokwenza iimirro ezininzi kwihlabathi liphela, kwaye apho ukufikelela akukavalwa ngokupheleleyo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text5"
msgstr "Ukuba singawela eli xesha, siya kuba sigcinile ulwazi kunye nenkcubeko yoluntu ngonaphakade. Asifanele sivumele eli xesha lichitheke. Asifanele sivumele eli xesha libalulekileyo livale kuthi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text6"
msgstr "Masihambe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.signature"
msgstr "- U-Anna kunye neqela (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.title"
msgstr "Ukufikelela okukhethekileyo kwiinkampani ze-LLM kweyona nqokelelo inkulu yeencwadi ezingezizo ezobuxoki zaseTshayina ehlabathini"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.subtitle"
msgstr "<a %(duxiu_exclusive_chinese)s>Inguqulelo yesiTshayina 中文版</a>, <a %(news_ycombinator)s>Xoxa kwiHacker News</a>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.tldr"
msgstr "<em><strong>TL;DR:</strong> I-Archive ka-Anna ifumene uqokelelo olukhethekileyo lweencwadi ezingezizo ezobuxoki zaseTshayina eziyi-7.5 yezigidi / 350TB — ezinkulu kune-Library Genesis. Silungele ukunika inkampani ye-LLM ukufikelela okukhethekileyo, ngokutshintshiselana nge-OCR ekumgangatho ophezulu kunye nokukhutshwa kombhalo.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text1"
msgstr "Le yiposti emfutshane yebhlog. Sifuna inkampani okanye iziko elinokunceda nge-OCR kunye nokukhutshwa kombhalo kwiqokelelo elikhulu esilifumeneyo, ngokutshintshiselana ngokufikelela kwangethuba okukhethekileyo. Emva kwexesha lokuthintela, siya kukhupha uqokelelo lonke."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text2"
msgstr "Umbhalo wezinga eliphezulu wezifundo ulusizo kakhulu ekuqeqesheni ama-LLM. Nakuba iqoqo lethu lingesiShayina, lokhu kufanele kube usizo ngisho nakuqeqesha ama-LLM esiNgisi: amamodeli abonakala ehlanganisa imiqondo nolwazi kungakhathalekile ulimi lwemvelaphi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text3"
msgstr "Ngalesi sizathu, umbhalo udinga ukukhipha kusuka kuzithombe. Yini i-Archive ka-Anna eyitholayo kulokhu? Ukusesha umbhalo ogcwele wezincwadi kubasebenzisi bayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text4"
msgstr "Ngoba izinhloso zethu zihambisana nezabathuthukisi be-LLM, sifuna ukubambisana. Sizimisele ukukunikeza <strong>ukufinyelela okukhethekile kusenesikhathi kuleli qoqo ngobuningi unyaka owodwa</strong>, uma ungakwazi ukwenza i-OCR efanele nokukhipha umbhalo. Uma uzimisele ukwabelana nathi ngekhodi ephelele yephayiphi yakho, sizimisele ukuvimba iqoqo isikhathi eside."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.example_pages"
msgstr "Amakhasi esibonelo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.example_pages.text1"
msgstr "Ukuze usibonise ukuthi unepayiphi elihle, nansi amakhasi ambalwa esibonelo okuqala ngawo, avela encwadini nge-superconductors. Iphayiphi yakho kufanele iphathe kahle izibalo, amatafula, amashadi, izinyathelo, njalonjalo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.example_pages.text2"
msgstr "Thumela amakhasi akho asebenziwe ku-imeyili yethu. Uma ebukeka kahle, sizokuthumelela okwengeziwe ngasese, futhi silindele ukuthi ukwazi ukuqhuba iphayiphi yakho ngokushesha nakulawo. Uma sesanelisekile, singenza isivumelwano."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection"
msgstr "Iqoqo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text1"
msgstr "Olunye ulwazi mayelana neqoqo. <a %(duxiu)s>Duxiu</a> iyisisekelo sedatha esikhulu sezincwadi eziskeniwe, esidalwe yi-<a %(chaoxing)s>SuperStar Digital Library Group</a>. Iningi lezincwadi ziyizincwadi zesayensi, eziskeniwe ukuze zitholakale ngedijithali ezikhungweni zemfundo ephakeme nasemitatsheni yezincwadi. Kubabukeli bethu abakhuluma isiNgisi, <a %(library_princeton)s>Princeton</a> kanye ne-<a %(guides_lib_uw)s>University of Washington</a> banemininingwane emihle. Kukhona futhi isihloko esihle esinikeza isizinda esengeziwe: <a %(doi)s>“Digitizing Chinese Books: A Case Study of the SuperStar DuXiu Scholar Search Engine”</a> (bheka ku-Archive ka-Anna)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text2"
msgstr "Izincwadi ezivela ku-Duxiu ziye zaphangwa isikhathi eside kwi-inthanethi yaseShayina. Imvamisa zithengiswa ngaphezu kwedola elilodwa ngabathengisi. Zivame ukusatshalaliswa kusetshenziswa okulingana kwe-Google Drive yaseShayina, okuvame ukugenca ukuze kuvumeleke isikhala esengeziwe sokugcina. Eminye imininingwane yezobuchwepheshe ingatholakala <a %(github_duty_machine)s>lapha</a> kanye <a %(github_821_github_io)s>lapha</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text3"
msgstr "Nakuba izincwadi ziye zasatshalaliswa ngokungaqondile, kunzima kakhulu ukuzithola ngobuningi. Sibe nalesi phezulu ohlwini lwethu lwe-TODO, futhi sanikezela izinyanga eziningi zomsebenzi wesikhathi esigcwele kulokhu. Nokho, muva nje, isisebenzi esingakholeki, esimangalisayo, nesinethalente sithintekile nathi, sithi senze wonke lo msebenzi kakade — ngezindleko ezinkulu. Basabelane nathi ngalo lonke iqoqo, ngaphandle kokulindela lutho emuva, ngaphandle kokuqinisekisa ukugcinwa kwesikhathi eside. Kuyamangalisa ngempela. Bavumile ukucela usizo ngale ndlela ukuze iqoqo lethu lenziwe i-OCR."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text4"
msgstr "Iqoqo liqukethe amafayela angu-7,543,702. Lokhu kudlula i-Library Genesis non-fiction (cishe izigidi ezi-5.3). Usayizi wefayela eliphelele cishe u-359TB (326TiB) ngendlela yalo yamanje."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text5"
msgstr "Sivulekele ezinye iziphakamiso nemibono. Xhumana nathi nje. Bheka i-Archive ka-Anna ukuze uthole olunye ulwazi mayelana namaqoqo ethu, imizamo yokugcinwa, nokuthi ungabasiza kanjani. Ngiyabonga!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.signoff"
msgstr "- U-Anna kunye neqela (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.zlib-on-ipfs.deprecated"
msgstr "Isixwayiso: le bhulogi isiyekile ukusebenza. Sinqume ukuthi i-IPFS ayikalungi okwamanje. Sisazoxhumanisa namafayela ku-IPFS kusuka ku-Archive ka-Anna uma kungenzeka, kodwa asisazosingatha thina uqobo, futhi asisabeki abanye ukuthi basebenzise i-IPFS. Sicela ubheke ikhasi lethu le-Torrents uma ufuna ukusiza ukugcina iqoqo lethu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.zlib-on-ipfs.title"
msgstr "Siza ukusabalalisa i-Z-Library ku-IPFS"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.title"
msgstr "Indlela yokusebenzisa umtapo wezincwadi ongabonakali: ukusebenza ku-Archive ka-Anna"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tldr"
msgstr "Ayikho <q>i-AWS yezinhlangano ezisiza abantu ezingabonakali,</q> ngakho-ke siyisebenzisa kanjani i-Archive ka-Anna?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.text1"
msgstr "Ngisebenzisa <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>i-Archive ka-Anna</a>, injini yokusesha enkulu kunazo zonke emhlabeni evulekile yomthombo engenzi nzuzo yezincwadi ezingabonakali, njenge-Sci-Hub, i-Library Genesis, ne-Z-Library. Inhloso yethu ukwenza ulwazi namasiko kutholakale kalula, futhi ekugcineni sakhe umphakathi wabantu abahlanganisa ndawonye bagcine <a %(blog_isbndb_dump_how_many_books_are_preserved_forever)s>zonke izincwadi emhlabeni</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.text2"
msgstr "Kulesi sihloko ngizokukhombisa ukuthi sisebenzisa kanjani le webhusayithi, nezinselelo ezihlukile eziza nokusebenza kwewebhusayithi enesimo esingaqondakali ngokomthetho, njengoba kungekho “AWS yezinhlangano ezisiza abantu ezingabonakali”."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.text3"
msgstr "<em>Futhi hlola isihloko esihlobene <a %(blog_how_to_become_a_pirate_archivist)s>Indlela yokuba umgcini wezincwadi ongabonakali</a>.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens"
msgstr "Iimpawu zokuQamba"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text1"
msgstr "Masisiqale ngesiseko setekhnoloji yethu. Siyenzile ukuba ibe yinto engeyoyonwabisa. Sisebenzisa iFlask, iMariaDB, kunye neElasticSearch. Yiyo yonke loo nto. Ukukhangela ikakhulu yingxaki esele isonjululwe, kwaye asizimisele ukuyiphinda. Ngaphandle koko, kufuneka sichithe <a %(mcfunley)s>iimpawu zethu zokuQamba</a> kwenye into: ukungathatyathwa phantsi ngabasemagunyeni."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text2"
msgstr "Ke ngoko, iAnna’s Archive isemthethweni kangakanani okanye ayikho semthethweni kangakanani? Oku kuxhomekeke kakhulu kumthetho welizwe. Amazwe amaninzi akholelwa kuhlobo oluthile lwamalungelo obunini, okuthetha ukuba abantu okanye iinkampani zinikwe ilungelo elikhethekileyo lokulawula iintlobo ezithile zemisebenzi ixesha elithile. Njengokuphawula, kwiAnna’s Archive sikholelwa ukuba nangona kukho izibonelelo ezithile, ngokubanzi amalungelo obunini ayingozi eluntwini — kodwa le yibali elinye ixesha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text3"
msgstr "Eli lungelo elikhethekileyo kwimisebenzi ethile lithetha ukuba akuvumelekanga ukuba nabani na ngaphandle kwalo lungelo alawule ngokuthe ngqo loo misebenzi — kubandakanya nathi. Kodwa iAnna’s Archive yinjini yokukhangela engalawuleli ngokuthe ngqo loo misebenzi (ubuncinci hayi kwiwebhusayithi yethu ecacileyo), ngoko ke kufuneka sibe semthethweni, akunjalo? Hayi kanye. Kumazwe amaninzi akuvumelekanga kuphela ukulawula imisebenzi enamalungelo obunini, kodwa nokudibanisa kwiindawo ezikwenzayo. Umzekelo oqhelekileyo wale nto ngumthetho weDMCA waseUnited States."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text4"
msgstr "Le yindawo engqongqo kakhulu. Kwelinye icala, ngokwethiyori, kungabakho amazwe angenayo imithetho yamalungelo obunini, kodwa lawo akakho ngokwenene. Phantse lonke ilizwe linomthetho othile wamalungelo obunini. Ukunyanzeliswa yibali elahlukileyo. Kukho amazwe amaninzi anoorhulumente abangakhathaleliyo ukunyanzelisa umthetho wamalungelo obunini. Kukwakho namazwe aphakathi kwezi zinto zimbini, avimbela ukulawula imisebenzi enamalungelo obunini, kodwa angavimbeli ukudibanisa kule misebenzi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text5"
msgstr "Olunye uqwalaselo lusemazingeni eenkampani. Ukuba inkampani isebenza kwindawo engakhathaleliyo amalungelo obunini, kodwa inkampani ngokwayo ayifuni kuthatha mngcipheko, ngoko banokuthi bavale iwebhusayithi yakho nje ukuba nabani na akhalaze ngayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text6"
msgstr "Ekugqibeleni, uqwalaselo olukhulu ziintlawulo. Kuba sifuna ukuhlala singaziwa, asinakusebenzisa iindlela zentlawulo zemveli. Oku kusishiya nemali yedijithali, kwaye kuphela inani elincinci leenkampani ezixhasa ezo (kukho amakhadi etyala edijithali ahlawulwa ngemali yedijithali, kodwa ahlala engamkelwa)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture"
msgstr "Ulwakhiwo lwenkqubo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text1"
msgstr "Ke masithi ufumene iinkampani ezikulungele ukubamba iwebhusayithi yakho ngaphandle kokuyivala — masizibize ezi “baxhasi benkululeko” 😄. Uya kufumanisa ngokukhawuleza ukuba ukubamba yonke into kunye nabo kubiza kakhulu, ngoko unokufuna ukufumana “abaxhasi abaxabisa kancinci” kwaye wenze ukubamba okwenyani apho, usebenzisa abaxhasi benkululeko njengabalamli. Ukuba uyenza kakuhle, abaxhasi abaxabisa kancinci abasoze bazi ukuba ubamba ntoni, kwaye abasoze bafumane zikhalazo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text2"
msgstr "Ngazo zonke ezi nkampani kukho umngcipheko wokuba ziya kukuvala nangona kunjalo, ngoko ke kufuneka ube nokuphindaphinda. Sifuna oku kuwo onke amanqanaba esiseko sethu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text3"
msgstr "Inkampani ethile enenkululeko ethile ezibeke kwindawo enomdla yiCloudflare. Bane <a %(blog_cloudflare)s>mpikiswano</a> yokuba abayiinkampani zokubamba, kodwa bayinkonzo, njengomnikezeli we-ISP. Ngoko ke abaphantsi kweDMCA okanye izicelo zokuthatha phantsi, kwaye badlulisa naziphi na izicelo kumnikezeli wakho wokubamba. Baya kude baye enkundleni ukukhusela olu lwakhiwo. Ngoko ke sinokubasebenzisa njengolunye uluhlu lokugcina kunye nokhuseleko."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text4"
msgstr "ICloudflare ayamkeli iintlawulo ezingaziwayo, ngoko sinokusebenzisa kuphela isicwangciso sabo sasimahla. Oku kuthetha ukuba asinakusebenzisa iimpawu zabo zokulinganisa umthwalo okanye ukungaphumeleli. Ngoko ke <a %(annas_archive_l255)s>siyenzile oku ngokwethu</a> kwinqanaba ledomeyini. Xa iphepha lilayisha, isikhangeli siya kujonga ukuba idomeyini yangoku isafumaneka, kwaye ukuba ayikho, sibhalela zonke ii-URL kwidomeyini eyahlukileyo. Njengoko iCloudflare igcina amaphepha amaninzi, oku kuthetha ukuba umsebenzisi unokufika kwidomeyini yethu ephambili, nokuba iseva yomlamli iphantsi, kwaye emva koko kwiklikhi elandelayo ahanjiswe kwidomeyini eyahlukileyo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text5"
msgstr "Siseneemiba eziqhelekileyo zokusebenza ekufuneka sijongane nazo, ezifana nokujonga impilo yeserver, ukungena kwiimpazamo zangasemva nangaphambili, njalo njalo. Ulwakhiwo lwethu lokungaphumeleli luvumela ukuqina ngakumbi kweli cala, umzekelo ngokusebenzisa iseti eyahlukileyo yeeseva kwenye yeedomeyini. Singaqhuba neenguqulelo ezindala zekhowudi kunye neDatasets kule domeyini eyahlukileyo, xa kukho impazamo ebalulekileyo kwinguqulelo ephambili engabonakaliyo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text6"
msgstr "Singakwazi nokukhusela ngokuchasene neCloudflare ukuba ijika kuthi, ngokuyisusa kwenye yeedomeyini, njengale domeyini eyahlukileyo. Iinguqulelo ezahlukeneyo zale mizekelo zinokwenzeka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools"
msgstr "Izixhobo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text1"
msgstr "Masijonge kwizixhobo esizisebenzisayo ukufezekisa konke oku. Oku kuyatshintsha kakhulu njengoko sijongana neengxaki ezintsha kwaye sifumana izisombululo ezintsha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.app"
msgstr "Iseva yesicelo: Flask, MariaDB, ElasticSearch, Docker."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.proxy"
msgstr "Iseva yomlamli: Varnish."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.management"
msgstr "Ulawulo lweseva: Ansible, Checkmk, UFW."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.dev"
msgstr "Uphuhliso: Gitlab, Weblate, Zulip."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.onion"
msgstr "Onion static hosting: Tor, Nginx."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text2"
msgstr "Kukho izigqibo esiye sabuyela kuzo. Enye yazo kukunxibelelana phakathi kweeseva: besikade sisebenzisa iWireguard kule nto, kodwa safumanisa ukuba ngamanye amaxesha iyayeka ukuthumela nayiphi na idatha, okanye ithumele idatha kwicala elinye kuphela. Oku kwenzeka ngeendlela ezahlukeneyo zeWireguard esizame ngazo, ezifana ne <a %(github_costela_wesher)s>wesher</a> kunye ne <a %(github_k4yt3x_wg_meshconf)s>wg-meshconf</a>. Sikwazame ukuhambisa izibuko ngaphezulu kwe-SSH, sisebenzisa i-autossh kunye ne-sshuttle, kodwa sahlangabezana ne <a %(github_sshuttle)s>ingxaki apho</a> (nangona kusekho ukungacaci kum ukuba i-autossh ihlupheka kwiingxaki ze-TCP-ngaphezulu-TCP okanye hayi — kuvakala ngathi sisombululo esingaqhelekanga kum kodwa mhlawumbi kulungile?)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text3"
msgstr "Endaweni yoko, sabuyela kwiingxibelelwano ezithe ngqo phakathi kweeseva, sifihla ukuba iseva iyasebenza kubanikezeli abaxabiso eliphantsi sisebenzisa i-IP-filtering nge-UFW. Oku kunesiphumo sokuba iDocker ayisebenzi kakuhle ne-UFW, ngaphandle kokuba usebenzise <code>network_mode: \"host\"</code>. Konke oku kunokuba yingozi ngakumbi, kuba uya kuveza iseva yakho kwi-intanethi ngempazamo encinci yokucwangcisa. Mhlawumbi kufuneka sibuyisele i-autossh — ingxelo iya kwamkeleka kakhulu apha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text4"
msgstr "Sikwabuyela umva kwiVarnish vs. Nginx. Okwangoku siyayithanda iVarnish, kodwa inezinto ezithile ezinqabileyo kunye nemiphetho emibi. Oku kuyasebenza kwiCheckmk: asiyithandi, kodwa iyasebenza okwangoku. IWeblate ibiyilungile kodwa ayimangalisi — ngamanye amaxesha ndiyoyika ukuba iya kulahleka idatha yam nanini na xa ndizama ukuyidibanisa ne-git repo yethu. IFlask ibiyilungile ngokubanzi, kodwa inezinto ezinqabileyo ezithile ezithathe ixesha elininzi ukulungisa, ezifana nokucwangcisa i-domain ezizodwa, okanye iingxaki zokudibanisa kwayo ne-SqlAlchemy."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text5"
msgstr "Ukuza kuthi ga ngoku ezinye izixhobo bezilungile: asinazo izikhalazo ezinzulu malunga neMariaDB, ElasticSearch, Gitlab, Zulip, Docker, kunye neTor. Zonke ezi ziye zaba neengxaki ezithile, kodwa akukho nto ibalulekileyo okanye ethatha ixesha elininzi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.conclusions"
msgstr "Isiphelo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.conclusions.text1"
msgstr "Ibe ngamava anomdla ukufunda indlela yokumisela injini yokukhangela ilayibrari yesithunzi eqinileyo nehlala ihleli. Kukho iinkcukacha ezininzi ezongezelelweyo zokwabelana ngazo kwiiposti ezizayo, ngoko ndazise ukuba ungathanda ukufunda ngakumbi ngantoni!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.conclusions.text2"
msgstr "Njengesiqhelo, sijonge iminikelo ukuxhasa lo msebenzi, ngoko qiniseka ukuba ujonge iphepha le-Donate kwi-Archive ka-Anna. Sikwajonge ezinye iintlobo zenkxaso, ezifana ne-grants, abaxhasi bexesha elide, ababoneleli ngeentlawulo eziphezulu, mhlawumbi nokuba (iintengiso ezimnandi!). Kwaye ukuba ufuna ukunikela ngexesha lakho kunye nezakhono, sihlala sijonge abaphuhlisi, abaguquleli, njalo njalo. Enkosi ngenzala yakho kunye nenkxaso."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.signature"
msgstr "- U-Anna kunye neqela (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.index.text1"
msgstr "Molo, ndingu-Anna. Ndidalile <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>I-Archive ka-Anna</a>, ilayibrari yesithunzi enkulu ehlabathini. Le yibhlog yam yobuqu, apho mna kunye neqela lam sibhalela ngorhwaphilizo, ukugcinwa kwedijithali, kunye nokunye."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.index.text2"
msgstr "Qhagamshelana nam ku <a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.index.text3"
msgstr "Qaphela ukuba le webhusayithi yibhlog nje. Sibamba kuphela amazwi ethu apha. Akukho ma-torrents okanye ezinye iifayile ezinelungelo lokushicilela ezibanjwe okanye ezidibanisiweyo apha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.index.heading"
msgstr "Iposti zebhlog"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.title"
msgstr "1.3B WorldCat scrape"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.books-on-ipfs.title"
msgstr "Ukubeka iincwadi ezingama-5,998,794 kwi-IPFS"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.books-on-ipfs.deprecated"
msgstr "Isixwayiso: le bhulogi isiyekile ukusebenza. Sinqume ukuthi i-IPFS ayikalungi okwamanje. Sisazoxhumanisa namafayela ku-IPFS kusuka ku-Archive ka-Anna uma kungenzeka, kodwa asisazosingatha thina uqobo, futhi asisabeki abanye ukuthi basebenzise i-IPFS. Sicela ubheke ikhasi lethu le-Torrents uma ufuna ukusiza ukugcina iqoqo lethu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.tldr"
msgstr "<em><strong>TL;DR:</strong> I-Archive ka-Anna yakhuhla yonke i-WorldCat (eyona ngqokelela inkulu ye-metadata yelayibrari ehlabathini) ukwenza uluhlu lwe-TODO lweencwadi ezimele zigcinwe.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text1"
msgstr "Kunyaka ophelileyo, sa <a %(blog)s>qalisa</a> ukuphendula lo mbuzo: <strong>Liphi ipesenti yeencwadi ezigcinwe ngokusisigxina ngelayibrari yesithunzi?</strong>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text2"
msgstr "Nje ukuba incwadi ifikelele kwilayibrari yesithunzi evulekileyo njenge <a %(wikipedia_library_genesis)s>Library Genesis</a>, kwaye ngoku <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>I-Archive ka-Anna</a>, iyaboniswa kwihlabathi lonke (ngama-torrents), ngaloo ndlela igcinwa phantse ngonaphakade."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text3"
msgstr "Ukuphendula umbuzo wokuba liphi ipesenti yeencwadi ezigcinwe, sifuna ukwazi isahlulelo: zingaphi iincwadi ezikhoyo zizonke? Kwaye ngokufanelekileyo asinayo inani kuphela, kodwa i-metadata yokwenene. Emva koko asikwazi kuphela ukuwafanisa ngokuchasene neelayibrari zesithunzi, kodwa sikwakwazi <strong>ukwenza uluhlu lwe-TODO lweencwadi eziseleyo ezimele zigcinwe!</strong> Singaqala nokuphupha ngomzamo owenziwe ngabantu abaninzi wokuhamba phantsi kolu luhlu lwe-TODO."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text4"
msgstr "Sikroba <a %(wikipedia_isbndb_com)s>ISBNdb</a>, kwaye sakhuphela <a %(openlibrary)s>Open Library dataset</a>, kodwa iziphumo azizange zanelise. Ingxaki ephambili yayikukuba kwakungekho kuhlangana okuninzi kwee-ISBNs. Jonga le Venn diagram kwi <a %(blog)s>ibhlog yethu</a>:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text5"
msgstr "Sasothukile kakhulu kukungahlangani okuncinci phakathi kwe-ISBNdb kunye ne-Open Library, zombini eziquka idatha evela kwimithombo eyahlukeneyo, efana nokukroba iwebhu kunye neerekhodi zeelabhulali. Ukuba zombini zenza umsebenzi omhle wokufumana uninzi lwee-ISBNs ezikhoyo, iimbombo zazo ngokuqinisekileyo ziya kuba nokuhlangana okukhulu, okanye enye iya kuba yinxalenye yelinye. Kwakusinika umdla, zingaphi iincwadi eziphuma ngokupheleleyo kwezi mbombo? Sifuna isiseko sedatha esikhulu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.worldcat"
msgstr "WorldCat"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text6"
msgstr "Yilapho sathi sajolisa kwisiseko sedatha esikhulu seencwadi emhlabeni: <a %(wikipedia_worldcat)s>WorldCat</a>. Le yisiseko sedatha esilawulwayo senkampani engenzi nzuzo <a %(wikipedia_oclc)s>OCLC</a>, esihlanganisa iirekhodi zetadata ezivela kwiilabhulali kwihlabathi liphela, ngokutshintshiselana ngokunika ezo labhulali ukufikelela kwiseti yedatha epheleleyo, kwaye zibonakale kwiziphumo zokukhangela zabasebenzisi bokugqibela."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text7"
msgstr "Nangona i-OCLC ingeyiyo inzuzo, imodeli yeshishini labo ifuna ukukhusela isiseko sedatha yabo. Ewe, siyaxolisa, bahlobo kwi-OCLC, siyinika yonke. :-)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text8"
msgstr "Kulo nyaka uphelileyo, sikroba ngononophelo zonke iirekhodi ze-WorldCat. Ekuqaleni, safumana ithamsanqa. I-WorldCat yayisandula ukuphehlelela uyilo olutsha lwewebhusayithi yabo (ngo-Agasti 2022). Oku kwabandakanya uhlaziyo olubalulekileyo lweenkqubo zabo zangasemva, ezazisa iziphene ezininzi zokhuseleko. Sathi gqi ngoko nangoko, kwaye sakwazi ukukroba amakhulu ezigidi (!) zeerekhodi kwiintsuku nje ezimbalwa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.alt.redesign"
msgstr "<em>WorldCat redesign</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text9"
